<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id">Nasepte</book>
  <para style="h">Nasepte</para>
  <para style="toc1">Nasepte</para>
  <para style="toc2">Nasepte</para>
  <para style="mt">Nasepte</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Theopilus, ka laigel masa pen ah, Jesu nasep chiil a kipata anasep leh thuhil zousie ka giel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hagau Siengthou panpina a, sawltah atelte kunga thupieh achiem zou a, van a puitou a aum ni donga thu ahi ka gel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Gentheina athuoh nuain sawltahte kungah theichienna zuoulou tampiin, hingin akimusah a, ni sawmli tangchim akung uah akilah a, Pasian gam thu toh kisai agenden hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amaute toh kipawlkhawm zelin, Jerusalem nusie sih unlen, “Pa thuchiem ka gensa na zah uh khu ngah un chin thu apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aziehpen Johan in tuiin ahing baptis a, hinanleh tua kipat ni sawtlou sungin Hagau Siengthou a baptis na hi ding uh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaziehin amaute ahing kikhawm ua, akungah “Mangpa tuin ahiei Israelte kunga leenggam na tunding kia ding?” chi’n adong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh Aman akung uah, “Pain ahun leh ani Ama thu thua um dinga aguot, noute thei ding ahisih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanleh na tung ua Hagau Siengthou ahing tun chiengin silbawltheina na nei ding ua, Jerusalem khuo ah, Judia gam leh Samaria gam zousie ah, tualeh kawlmong dongin ka thu theipite na hi ding uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tam thute agen zouin, amitmu ngel uah van ah lahtouin a um a, tuachia aetlai un, meilum in amu phahlou uah apuitouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh van a akaltou lai mitphelou a aet zing lai un, mi ni puon vam silin akung uah ahing ding ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua mi nite’n amaute kungah, “Nou Galili mite bangding a, vanlam en a dingden na hi uoi? Tam Jesu mama na kung ua kipat a, van a puitou a um, van a akaltou na mu bang ngelngel un, Ama ngel hing peikia ding ahi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n Olive muol achi ua kipat in Jerusalem khuo ah ahing peikia uhi, tua Olive muol khu Jerusalem khuo toh kinai ahia, Sabbath ni a peitheina tan bep ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amauh khopi ahing lut tah un, aumna uh Inndan tungnung ah akaltou uhi. Amaute khu, Peter, Jakob, Johan, Andru, Philip leh Thomas; Bartholomai leh Mathiu, Alphai tapa Jakob leh Simon Zealot leh Jakob tapa Juda ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tam mite zousie leh numeite leh Jesu nu Mari toh Jesu sanggamte toh lungsim munkhat puain phatuom ngaitahin thu angen khawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ni in Peter nuazuite lah ah adingtou a (abawn un za leh sawmni vel a hi ua.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Mite leh Sanggamte aw, masanglai a Hagau Siengthou in David kam a, Jesu mante lamkai a pangpa Juda tungtang thu Laisiengthou in ana gensa khu ahing tangtung ding mawng ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aziehpen amapa ilah ua simtel ahi a, tami nasepna ah zong tan anei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuin tam mipa’n agitlouna thamanin mun khat alei a, abungbusipin akie a, agilpi apohkeh a, agilzam zousie alawtkhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua thupen Jerusalema um zousiein ana thei ua, tuachi’n tuamun khu amauh ham in Akeldama achi uhi. (Tua khu sisan mun china ahi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aziehpen late bu sungah: Ama umna suhgam in um henlen; asungah koima um sih heh; tualeh alamkai hina midangin luota heh, chiin akigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa Jesu eite lah a lut leh pawt a a um sung sie a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Johan baptisma akipat a, ilah ua kipata van a puitou a aum ni donga, eita hing na kithuopite lah a mi khat, athawkiana hing theipi dingin a um ngeingei ding ahi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuachi’n mi ni aguot ua, khat khu Joseph Barsaba (amindang Justus achipa uh) tualeh khat khu Mathias ahi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh thu angen ua, “Mangpa Nang mihing zousie lungtang theipa, tam mi nite lah ah koizawh ahiei na tel hing theisah in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Juda lah ama umna mun ngai ah apei a, tami nasepna leh sawltah hina khelna zieh a apuasanna mun luo dingin,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tualeh ai asan ua, a ai san u’khu Mathias tungah a tu a, tuachi’n ama khu sawltah sawm leh khatte lah a simtel ahita hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh Pentikos ni ahing tunin a bawn un mun khat ah lungsim mun khat puoin a umkhawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thakhat in huipi hat tah laang banga ging, van a kipat ahing um phut a, atouna inn sung uh adim siengta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n leite ama leh ama kihawmzahin meikuong bangin atung uah khat chiet in ahing tuta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh abawn un Hagau Siengthouin adimta ua, Hagauin ahamsah bangbangin ham tuom in ahing hamta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuin van nuoi nam chin lah a kipat Pasian ngaisah Judate, Jerusalem ah a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh tua husa ging azah tahun, mipi tampi ahing peikhawm ua, athugente uh mi zousie in amauh hamchiet a azah tah un alungbuoita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n abawn un lamdang asa ua, amangbang uhi. “En vawi un, tana hamte zousie Galili gam mi ngen hilou ahi uoi mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bangchidan ahiei ibawnpi ua eima pienpi ham chiet a izah valong uh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pawlkhat Parthia mite, Medes mite, Elam mite, Mesopotamia gama umte, Kappadosia gama umte, Judia gam a umte, Pontius gam a umte, Asia gam a umte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Phrigia gam a umte, Pamphilia gama umte Izipt gama umte, tualeh sairin gam kimvel a Libia gamkai a umte ihi ua, tualeh pawlkhatte Rome akipat khuolzin Juda mi leh abieh dan uh zuite ihi uhi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pawl khatte Krit gam leh Arab gam mi bang ihi ua, hinanleh Pasian silbawl thupi agen uh eima ham chietin iza uhi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh abawn un lamdang asa ua, angaina theilouin “Bangchi dan adiei?” chi’n, khat leh khat akidong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pawlkhat in “El houin uoin tha kham hibou uh e,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hinanleh Peter khu sawm leh khatte toh ading khawm a, aw ngaitah in amaute kungah, thu agen a, “Nou Judia gam mite leh Jerusalem khuo a um zousiete aw, Tam thu thei unlen, ka thu zong ngaikhie un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tam miten na gintat bangun zu akham sih uhi, vaihamsang ahi pan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hinanleh tamte guolnei Joel in ana gen hing tangtung ahizaw hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pasian in ni nukhiate ah, tambang ahing hi ding: Mizousie tungah, ka Hagau ka sungbaw dinga, Na tapate u’leh, na tanute un ka thu agen ding ua, na tangvalte un mengmute amu ding ua, Na putehte un Mang amanding uhi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh ka suohpate leh, ka suohnute tungah zong, Ka Hagau ka sungbaw dinga amauten ka thu agen ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tunglam van ah sil lamdangte, nuoilam lei ah chiemtenate, Sisan leh mei leh meikhu hu, ka musah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mangpa ni thupi leh, minthangtah ahing tun masangin, Ni a miel dinga, hapi sisan asuoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh tambang ahi dinga, Koizong Mangpa min lou tapou, hundam ahi ding hi, achi hi, chi’n ana genta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Nou Israel mite aw, tam thu na ngai un, Nazareth Jesu, Pasian in Ama zangin na lah uah sil lamdangte sil thupite leh chiemtenate bawlin Pasian midih ahi chi noute lah ah akilangsahta hi, noute mama in zong na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Jesu khu Pasian lemguotsa leh theikholsa bangin noute khut a piehkhiet ahi a, nouten danbei a gamta migiloute khut in kross ah na kilbeh ua na thatta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama khu Pasian in shina gahnate sutpiehin akaithouta hi, shina tuhden guol ahilou zieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Aziehpen David in Ama tungthu ana gen a: Mangpa khu ka masangah bangchihlai pouin, ka mu ngitnget hi, Suhling a ka um louna dingin, ka zietlam ah a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuaziehin ka lungtangin nuom asa a, tualeh ka lei zong akipah hi; Tuathamlouin ka tahsa zong, kinem tahin akhawldam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Aziehpen ka hinna mishi khuo ah, na nuasie sih dinga, Na misiengthoupa zong, amuot ding na phal sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nangman hinna lampite Na hing theisahta a, Na hing umpi zieh in lungnopna toh, na hing sudim ding hi, ana chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Mite leh sanggamte aw, ahing suongtu David thu hangsan tahin na kung uah ka gen thei hi, ama pen ashita, vui zong avuita uh, ahan zong tu dongin ikung uah aum na lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ama khu guolnei ahi a, tahsa dan a, ama hahlesuona Mangtoupha a tou ding, Khrist, ka hing tungdoh ding chi’n Pasian in kihahsiel in agen hi, chi athei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Aman tam thu ana theikholsa ahi ziehin, Khrist thawkia ding thu ana gen hi. Ama mishikhuo ah nuasie in a um sih a, aluong zong amuot sih hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tam Jesu khu Pasian in akaithou kiata ngei a, ka unpi un tuami theipite ka hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuaziehin Pasian khut zietlam ah pahtawi in a um a, Hagau Siengthou chiem khu Pa kunga kipat in amu a, na mu uleh na zah uh khu ahing sungbuo ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />David pen van ah akaltou sih hi, ama mama in: Mangpa’n ka Mangpa kungah, ka ziet lam ah touin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Na melmate na kengphang ngahna a, ka bawl masangsiein, achi hi, ana chizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tuaziehin Jesu na kilbehpa ngel u’khu, Pasian in Mang leh Khrist in abawlta chi, Israel nam zousiein chientah in thei u’heh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Amaun tam thu azah tahun, alungtang uh sut bangin ahing nata a, Peter leh sawltah dangte kungah, “Mite leh unaute aw, bang ka bawlta ding uoi?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tuachi’n Peter in akung uah, “Kisia in lunghei unlen, na khelna uh ngaidam ahina dingin, Jesu Khrist min in baptisma tang chietun, tuachi’n Hagau Siengthou silpieh na tang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Athuchiem khu nouma dingin zong na tate uh dingin zong, gamla tah a umte dingin zong, Mangpa Pasian in ahat poumate dingin zong ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tualeh thudang tampi in ahilchien a, “Tulai khangtha giloute lah ah kihumbit un,” chiin ahantawh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tuachi’n athu kipahtah a pom pouma in, baptisma atang chiet ua, tua niin mi tul thum vela belap in a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tualeh sawltahte thuhil leh kipawlkhawmna ah, tanghou aphalsuo ua, phatuomngaitaha thungen in a um zing uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tuachi’n mi zousie tungah zauna ahing uma, sawltahten sillamdang leh chiemtena tampi abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Agingta zousie akipumkhat ua a umkhawm ua, bangkim akikop uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tualeh asil nei zousie uh azua ua, akitahsapna bangun a unpi lah uah ahawm zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tuachi’n ni chinin lungsim munkhat puoin Pasian biehinn ah, phatuom ngaitahin a um zel ua, a inn lam na ngawn uah zong tanghou phalsuoin kipahtah leh lungkim tahin a ann uh ane zel uhi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Pasian phat in mi zousien deisahna atang uhi. Tualeh hundamna hing mu poumate, Mangpa’n ni chinin abelappieh zel hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ni khat nai kuona, thunget hun lai in Peter leh Johan biehinn ah apeitou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh apien chiil a kipat kengbai koi ahiei pasal khat ahing puo ua, tua mipa khu bieh inn a lutte kunga khutdaw dingin biehinn “Kotpi hoi” kichi bul ah nichinin alumsah zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aman, Peter leh Johan biehinn huongsung a lut ding amu a, khut ana daw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Peter in Johan toh kengbaipa a ensaal den ua, “Koute gel hing en vawi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman amautegel apat bang ahiei mu kinem in a en hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n Peter in, “Dangka leh sana bangma ka nei sih, hinanleh ka neisun ka hing pe ding; Nazareth Jesu Khrist min in thou inlen, kengin pei in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi kawm in akhut zietlam a tuin akaithou a, thakhat in akengte leh asiehmitgute, ahing hatpai ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n amapa adingdoh a akengin apeita hi, tualeh akenga pei a, dieng dieng kawm leh Pasian phat kawmin, amautegel toh bieh inn huongsungah alutta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh akenga apei leh Pasian apahtawi mi zousie’n amu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaun biehinn kotpi hoi bul a khutdaw a tou zelpa ahi chi athei ua, a tunga siltung lamdang sa sengsengin achiza vawt uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh kengbai hing dampain Peter leh Johan akhuttuh lai in mi zousie in lamdang asa sengseng ua, Solomon innliep achi uah ahing taikhawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachia Peter in tua khu amu tahin mipite ahoupi a, “Nou Israel mite aw, bangdinga tami lamdangsa na hi uoi mah? Ahisihleh kouma silbawltheina leh Pasian ka ngaisah zieh ua, ama ka peisah uh bang hiel a hing en na hi uoi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Abraham, Isaak leh Jakobte Pasian ipu leh pate Pasian in, atapa Jesu atawisangta ahi. Ama na mansah ua, Pilat in ha a, peisah atup lai nangawn a zong amai tanga na nuol vevawpa uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hinanleh nouten Misiengthoupa leh Dihtatpa na deisih ua, tuolthatpa khat hing ha pieh dingin na ngenzaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hinna siempa na that ua, hinanleh Pasian in Ama khu mishi lah akipat in akaithou kia a, koute tuami theipite ka hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama min agintat ziehin, Amin in tam mipa na mu u’leh na thei uh khu asuhatta hi; Ahi, Jesu zieha ginna hing um in, na un ua mitmuin asudam sieng vilvelta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Hinanleh unaute aw, na lamkaite un ana bawl bangun na theiloupi ua tambanga bawl na hi uh chi ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hinanleh Pasian in a guolneite zousie kam a, Khrist in genthei athuoh ngei ding ahi chi ana genlawhsa khu tambangin atangtung sahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuaziehin kisia unlen, na khelnate uh phietmang ahi theina dingin Mangpa lam ah kihei un, tuachi’n, Mangpa kunga kipat in halna hun ahing tung thei dinga;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh Jesu Khrist noute a dinga aguotsa khu ahing sawl ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bangkim bawlhoi hun atun masangsie, van in Ama akem tadi ding a, tuo bawlhoi hun pen Pasian in leitung kisiemchil apat a, aguolnei Siengthoute zousie kam in ana gensa diem ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Aziehpen Mosi in ipu ipate kungah, Mangpa Pasian in, Keima ahing siem bangin, na unaute lah ah guolnei khat ahing siem pieh ding, Aman thu zousie na kung ua agen pouma na ngaikhietpieh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahi dinga, mi koipou tua guolnei thugen ngaikhe lou pouma mipite lah akipat suhmang ahi ding uh achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ahi, Samuel um akipat a guolnei zousie leh anua a, guolnei um zousie thu ana gen pouma in tulai hun ding ana genlawh chiet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Noute, guolneite leh thuhun tate na hi uh, Pasian in Abraham kungah, nahah nasuonte ziehin leitunga innkuon zousie guolzawl in umva uh, chiin ipu ipate kungah achiem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Pasian in a Tapa Jesu kaithouin, na khelnate uh kiheisansah ding leh guolzawl dingin, noute kungah ahing sawl masapen hi,” achi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Peter leh Johan in mite kunga thu agen lai un, siempute leh biehinn veng galkap lamkaipa leh Saddukaite akung uah ahing pei ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sawltahten Jesu zala mishi laha kipat a thawkiana thu mite ahil ziehun, alungkimta sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh aman ua, nitahlam ahi ziehin, azingni tandongin suongkul ah akhumta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hinanleh, thu ngaikhete lah a mi tampi in atahsang ua, atam lam uh pasal ngen tulnga vel apha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh azingniin a vaihawmte u’leh upate leh laigiel mite,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh siempu lien Annas, Kaiapha, Johan leh Alexander leh siempu lienpa innkuonte zousie, Jerusalem ah akikhawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh amaun Peter leh Johan alai uah ading sah ua, “Bang thuneina leh bang min a tambang na bawl uh ahiei?” chi’n adong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n Peter khu Hagau Siengthouin adim a, “Nou vaihawm mite leh Israel upate aw,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kouten tunia mi hatlou khat tunga silhoi ka bawlna u’leh amapa bangchidan a hing damdoh ahiei chi na hing doh uleh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Noute, zousie leh Israel mite zousiein zong thei un, Nazareth Jesu Khrist kross a na killuppa uh, Pasian in mishi lah akipat akaithou kia a Ama min ngelngel in tam mipa na bawn ua masangah dam in adingta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nou innlam miten na suong deilou uh, aninga suong poimawpen kichi khu Ama ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Midang koima kungah hundamna a um sih, van nuoia mihingte kunga kipie min lah ah, ei hing hundam ding min dang mawngmawng a um sih hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amaun Peter leh Johan hansan dan amu tah un, laisiemlou leh mi mawltah ahi uh chi athei ua, lamdang asa mama ua, Jesu kungah ana umta uh chi atheita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh ami suhdampa uh amautegel kunga ding amu un, bangmain asoisel thei tuon sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hinanleh vaihawmpawl toukhawmte apata apei tuomsah nua un, thu akikum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Tam mite bang ilawta ding uoi? Sil lamdang minthang abawl uh Jerusalem khuo a um zousie in kichientah in atheita ua, eiten zong iniel thei tuom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hinanleh tam thu mite kunga akithan belap nawn louna dingin, tukalsie tam mipa mina, koima kunga thu gen nawnlou dingin, khautah in vau vai,” akichi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n amautegel ahan ua, Jesu min a thu gen kia nawn lou ding leh hilkia nawn lou ding in thu apeta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hinanleh Peter leh Johan in akung uah, Pasian mitmuin, “Pasian thu man sangin noute thu man adih zaw diei mah? nouten ngaisut un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kouten ka sil mute u’leh ka zahte uh, gen louin ka um thei sih uhi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaun amautegel khau zawsem a vau toh ha athuo uhi, mipite ziehin gawtna lemtang amu sih uhi; asil bawl zieh un mi zousie in Pasian apahtawita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Aziehpen lamdangtah a suhdam a umpa khu kum sawmli sanga upa zaw ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh Peter leh Johan kihakhiet tah un, aguolte uh kungah apei ua, siempu liente leh upaten agen zousie uh ahilta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuachi’n amauten tua thu azah tah un, lungsim munkhat puoin aw ngai tah in Pasian kungah, “Mangpa Nang van leh lei tualeh tuipi leh asunga um zousie siempa Pasian na hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nang na suohpa David kam in Hagau Siengthou in thu na gen a. Bangchidan a namte lungthah a, bangdinga mipiten, sil phatuomlou angaituo uh ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Leitung kumpipate pangkhawmin ading ua, Mangpa leh Khrist dou in, vaihawm mite akikhawm uhi; achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Adihtah in, na Suohpa Siengthou, na thaunu Jesu dou in, tami khopi sungah Herod leh Pontius Pilat leh Jentelte leh Israel mite akikhawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nangma deina leh na khutin bawl dinga atup leh na guotlawhsa pouma bawl dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuin Mangpa aw, koute ahing vaunate en inlen, na suohten hangsantaha na thu agen theina ding uh pie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Na suoh Siengthou Jesu min zal a chinate damsah ding leh chiemtenate leh sil lamdangte, abawl theina dingun na khut hing zah nalai in,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tualeh athum zou un, a umkhawmna mun uh ahing kilinga, tualeh abawn un Hagau Siengthouin ahing dim siengta ua, Pasian thu hangsan tahin agenta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuin agingta mipite khu, lungsim munkhat leh ngaituona munkhat in a um ua, alah ua khat in zong a sil neite khu kei a tuom ahi achi sih a, sil zousie akitaang zel zaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tualeh sawltahten silbawltheina thupitah toh, Mangpa Jesu thawkiana theipina thu agen gen ua a, a unpi ua tungah khotuona thupitah a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Alah uah koima tasam a um sih ua, gamte, ahisihleh innte, anei tapouin azua ua, akhotna sumte uh ahing tawi ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Sawltahte keng bulah ahing koi zel uhi, tualeh mi khat poupou in tahsap anei chiengin akihawm chiet zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tualeh Joses sawltahten Barnaba achi uh (amin khiehna ahileh kihantawhna tapa china ahi) Levimi Saipras tuikuolkhum gam mi ahi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Agam nei khu azua a, asum ahing tawi a, sawltahte keng bul ah akoita hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hinanleh mi khat amin Anania in azi Saphira toh aneisa khat uh azua ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh aman sekhat ama a dingin a im a, azi in zong athei hi, tualeh sekhat hing tawi in sawltahte keng bul ah akoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hinanleh Peter in, “Anania Hagau Siengthou sol ding leh gam man sekhat im ding a, Setan in na lungtang aluodim bangchidan ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Gam khu zua lou a aum lai in, nanga hilou ahiei mah? na zua nua in zong nangma thuthu hinalai lou ahiei mah? Bangdinga tambang sil bawl dinga na lungtang a ngaituo na hiei? Mihing sol na hi sih a, Pasian sol na hi zaw hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Anania in tam thu azah tahin apua a, ashita hi. Tuachi’n tam thu za zousie azau mama ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n tangvalte akipan ua, Anania luong atuom ua, azawngdoh ua, avuita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh naikal thum ding vel nuain, bang sil tung ahiei chi theiloupi in azi ahing lut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n Peter in akungah, “Hing hil in gam na zuana uh hiza bep ma ahi na amah” chiin adonga, amanu’n “Hi hiza bep ma hina,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n Peter in akungah, “Bangchidan a, Mangpa Hagau ze et ding a kithutuoh na hi uoi? Ngai in, na pasal vuite keng kotkhah bul ah ahing tungta, nang zong ahing zawng ding uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuatahin akeng bulah apua pai a ashita hi. Tuachi’n tangvalte ahing lut ua, amanu shisa in amu ua, azawng doh ua, apasal kungah avuita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaziehin hattuom zousie leh tam thu za kha pouma nasatahin azauta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh Pasian in Sawltahte khutin mite lahah, chiemtena leh sillamdang tampi abawl hi. Tualeh amaute abawn un lungsim munkhat puoin Solomon innliep ah a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahinlah alah uah koima atel ngamta sih uhi; hinanleh miten amaute pahtatna lienpi anei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Gingtha mi apung semsem ua, numei leh pasal tampi Mangpa kungah ahing kibelap deudeu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n miten chinate ahing zawpi ua, gawlzingte ah lupnate leh pheh tungte ah alumsah uhi; Peter ahing pei chienga ahim beeh mi pawlkhat tunga tu a alie theina dingin, abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jerusalem kim a khuote akipat in zong mipite ahing peikhawm ua damloute leh dawibuain asuhgentheite ahing pui ua, amaute zousie suhdamin a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n Siempu lien leh alawmte akisa ua ahing pei ua (alawmte khu Saddukai pawl ahi uhi,) thangsietna in adim uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh Sawltahte aman ua, mi vantang khumna suongkul ah akhum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hinanleh zanlai in Mangpa vansawlsieng khat in suongkul kotkhate ahing honga, amauh apuidoh a, akung uah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Pei unlen Biehinn sung ah ding unlen, mipite kungah tam hinna thu zousie va gen un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tam thu azah tahun, zingmawng matahin bieh inn ah ava lut ua, thu ahilta uhi. Hinanleh siempu lien leh a lawmte ahing pei ua, vaihawmte leh Israel tate upate zousie ahan khawm ua, sawltahte va pui dingin suongkul ah mi asawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hinanleh biehinn veng lamkaite ava pei ua, suongkul ah amaute ava muta sih ua, ahing kinuale kiata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Suongkul bittah a kikhain leh avengmite zong kotkhah bul a ding ka mu ua, hinanleh ka hon uleh asung ah koima ka mu sih uhi,” chiin agen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Siempu lienpen leh biehinn veng lamkaipa tualeh siempu lienten tam thu azah un lamdang asa ua, bang thu ahing thangdoh ta bep diei izaw, achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuachi’n mi khat ahing pei a, akung uah, “En un, suongkul a na mikhumte un, biehinn ah dingin mi ahil uhi,” chiin ahing gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuachi’n biehinn veng galkap lamkaipa leh galkap lamkaite ava pei ua, mipite agiin zieh un, thagumsuo louin ahing zawpi uhi, tuahisihleh suonga se ahi kha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tualeh amauh ahing pui tung tah un, vaihawm pawlte mai ah adingsah ua, tuachi’n siempu lien in akung uah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Tampa min a thu hil nawn lou dingin thu khautahin ka hing peta uh hilou amah? Thei un, na thu hil un Jerusalem khuo na sudim siengta uhi, tualeh tam mipa asisan phuba koute tunga hing khuhsah sawm na hi uh,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuachi’n Peter leh Sawltah dangten adawng ua, “Mihing thu sangin Pasian thu ka man zawh ding uh ahi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Nouten singa na khai ua, na thapa uh Jesu, ipu ipate Pasian in akaithouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ama khu Pasian in leengtapa leh hundampa hi dingin azietlam ah apahtawita a, Israelte kunga kisia a lungheina leh khel ngaidamna pe dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Koute tam thute theipimite ka hi uhi, Pasian in Ama thu zuite pouma kunga apieh, Hagau siengthou zong Ama theipipa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Amauten tam thu azah tah un, alungthah mama ua, sawltahte tha atumta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tuachi’n vaihawm mite lah a Pharisai mi khat amin Gamiliel, dan hil sie, mi zousiein a zatat mama uh, adingdoh a pulam a sawltahte hun tomnoukhat puidoh tadi dingin thu apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tualeh amaute kungah, “Nou Israel mite aw, tam mite tunga na sil bawl sawm uh pilvang un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tu masangin zong Theuda milien ka hi chi ahing um a, mi zali velin anua azui uhi. Ama tha in a um a, ama muonga zuite akithezah siengta ua, bangma ahita sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tua mipa nuain minkhum lai in Galili gam mi Juda ahing um kia a, akungah mi tampi ahip a hinanleh Ama zong amangthangta a, Ama muonga zuite zong akikhenzahta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tuaziehin tuin noute kungah ka gen ahi, tam mite apat kihemkhie unlen, hichiin umsah kuom unlen, hata un, asil tup uleh asilbawlte uh mihing akipan ahileh, bangma louin ahing mang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Hinanleh Pasian akipan ahileh, na sumang zou sih ding uhi, Tuachilouin pen Pasian dou nahi kha zaw ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tualeh athugen khu pha asata ua, tuachi’n sawltahte ahan ua, ajep ua, ajep zou un, Jesu min a thu gen kia nawnlou dingin thu apie ua, ahata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tuachi’n amauh vaihawmte lah a kipat in apawtkhie ua, Jesu min zieh a zumna thuohtah a guot ahi zieh un akipah mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tualeh nichin in Pasian biehinn leh inn chin ah Jesu khu Khrist ahi chia thuhil leh gen akhawl thei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua hun lai a nuazuite ahing pun semsem laiun, ani china asil hawm thu uah, Greek ham zang meithaite na nelsie uhi chiin, Greek ham zang Judate Hebrute tungah aphun ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n sawm leh niten nuazui mipite ahankhawm ua, “Pasian thugen tawpsan a, nehletah ka sai uh adih sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaziehin unaute aw, na lah ua Hagau Siengthou leh pilna adim, mi min hoi ngen sagi tel unlen, amaute tam nna sem dinga ka guot theina dingun, achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Koute pen thum leh thu nasem in ka um zom den zaw ding uhi,” achi uhi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua thuin mi zousie akipahsaha, tuachi’n Stephen ginna leh Hagau Siengthou a dim toh, Philip leh Prokora toh, Nikanor leh Timon toh Parmena leh Judate biehdan zui Antiok khuo a mi Nikola toh atel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amaute khu sawltahte masangah a ding sah ua, tualeh thumna neiin, atung uah akhut uh anga uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n Pasian thu ahing kithedal semsem a, Jerusalem khuo ah nuazuite apungta mama ua, tuachi’n siempute lah ah zong mi tampi ginna lam ah athumangta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh Stephen ginna leh silbawltheina a dimin, mite lah ah sillamdang leh chiemtena thupi tahte abawl zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n zalensah mite kikhopna inn kichi akipat Sairin khuo a mite Alexandria khuo a mite leh Silisia leh Asia gam a kipat Judate pawl khat ahing kisa ua, Stephen ahing kinielpi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hinanleh apilna leh Hagau zal a athugente anielkhe theita sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n amauten simtham in mi achiil ua, “Stephen in Mosi leh Pasian agensiet lam ka za uhi,” achisah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh amauten mipite, upate leh laigiel mite achiilsie ua, Stephen amansah ua, vaihawmte kungah ahing pui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amauten theipi zuoutheite abawl ua, tua miten, “Tam mipa’n mun siengthou leh dan agensie ngitnget hi achi uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aziehpen tami Nazareth Jesu’n tami mun siengthou asuse dinga, Mosi in dan ahing piehte asulamdang ding hi, chia agen kaza uhi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n vaihawmna a toute zousiein Stephen khu a en sal chiet ua, amel khu vansawlsieng mel bangin amu uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n siempu lien in, “Tam thute adih ahina amah?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh Stephen in unaute leh pate aw, “Ngai un, ipu uh Abraham, Haran khuo a aum masanga Mesapotamia gam a a um lai in, thupina Pasian khu akungah ahing kilah a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Akungah na gam leh na innkuonpite lah a kipat hing peidoh inlen, keiman ka hing etsah ding gam ah hing pei in achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n ama Kaldaite gam a kipat apeidoh a, Haran ah atengta hi. Tualeh apa shi nuain, Pasian in khuna pat in, tu a na tenna gam uah ahing pemlut sahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh tam gam ah Pasian in ama mun luo ding ape sih a, akeng tatna ding khop nangawn ape sih hi. Hinanleh Abraham in ta aneilou lai nangawnin, Pasian in ama goutan ding leh anua a ahah asuonte goutan dingin pieh achiem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh Pasian in tambangin agen hi, ahah asuonte mi gam ah atam ding ua, suohin akhawi ding ua, kum zali sung asugenthei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh Pasian in, suoh a aumna ding uh nam khu keiman ka gawt dinga, tuazou chiengin ahing pawlkhe ding ua, tam mun ah ka nna asem ding uh, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n Pasian in akungah, teptan thuhun apie hi, tuachi’n Abraham in Isaak ahinga ani giet ni in atep atan hi; tuachi’n Isaak in Jakob ahing a, Jakob in chi suong mi sawm leh nite ahing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Tualeh chi suong miten thangsietna a hing nei ua, Joseph khu Izipt gam ah azuata uhi. Hinanleh Pasian in Joseph a umpi a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Agentheina zousie apat ahunkhe zel a, Izipt leengpa Pharaoh mitmu ah deisahna leh pilna apie a, tuachi’n ama khu Izipt gam leh a inn sung mite tungah uhpipa in abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n Izipt gam pumpi leh Kanaan gam ah kiel ahing tunga, gimthuohna nasatah ahing umta a, ipu ipate un neh ding mawngmawng amuta sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hinanleh Jakob in Izipt gam ah bu a um chi azahtah in ipute uh asawldoh a, tuakhu apei masahna pen uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh anivei peina uah, Joseph in asanggamte akitheisah a, tualeh Joseph sanggamte khu Pharaoh atheisahta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n Joseph in apa Jakob leh a innkuonte han dingin mi a sawl a, tualeh a innkuonte abawn un sawmsagi leh nga, ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jakob khu Izipt gam ah apeisuh a, tualeh ama leh ipute uh ashita ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aluonguh Sekem khuo ah apotung ua Abraham in Sekem khuo a, Hamor tapate kunga dangka sum a alei, han ah avuita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Hinanleh Pasian in Abraham kunga athuchiem atangtunna hun ahing naitahin Izipt gam a imite ahing pung ua, atam deu deu ta ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Joseph thei kha lou leeng dang ahing um masangsie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua leengpa’n imite aze bawl a, ipu ipate uh abawlgenthei a, atangehte uh hing lou dingin apaidoh sah zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua hun lai in Mosi apieng a, amel hoi mama a, apa inn sungah ha thum akem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama akoidoh tah un, Pharaoh tanu in ala a, ama tapa dingin akemta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mosi in Izipt mite pilna zousie azil a, tuachi’n thugen leh silbawl ah, athupi mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Mosi kum sawmli ahing chin tahin, a unau Israelte ve utna lungsim anei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuabanga ava ve lai in, alah ua mi khat dihloutah a suhgenthei a um amu a, ava hun a, suhgenthei a umpa phuba alah pieh a, Izipt mi khu asatlum ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Aziehpen ama’n ama khut a Pasian in a unaute hundoh ding ahi, chi amaun thei ding asa a, hinanleh amaun athei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Azing niin Mosi in Israelmi ni kihau laitah atuohkha a, lawmte aw, unau khat na ve uo le, bangdinga dihloutah a kibawl na hi uoi? chiin lep ava sawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hinanleh a innvengpa tunga silgilou bawl zawpa’n Mosi asawndoh a, Koute tunga vaihawm ding leh thukhen dinga nang koiin ahing guot ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Zanni a Izipt mi na tha banga, hing tha sawm na hiei mah? achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuachi’n tam thu ziehin Mosi ataimangta a, Midian gam ah khuolzin mi bangin ava tamta hi, Tuanah tapa ni ava nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“Tualeh kum sawmli abei nuain, Sinai muol gamdai ah vansawlsieng khat sawlbawh meikuong in akungah ava kilah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Mosi in tuakhu amu tahin, asilmu khu lamdang asa mama a, en dinga ava nai lai in, Mangpa aw in akungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Kei na pu napate Pasian, Abraham Pasian, Isaak Pasian leh Jakob Pasian, ka hi, achi hi. Tuachi’n Mosi achitun a, a en ngamta sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n akungah, na keng apat na kengdap sut in, na dinna mun lei siengthou ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Izipt gam a um ka mite kibawlgenthei dan chientah in ka mu zing a, athum leh maunate u’zong ka zata a, amauh hunkhe dinga, hing peisuh ka hi. Kisa in Izipt gam ah ka hing sawl ding, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />“Tami Mosi khu ahi, koute tunga vaihawm ding leh thukhen dinga nang koi hing guot a hiei? chia a nuolpa uh, sawlbawh lah a akunga hing kilah vansawlsieng khut in, Pasian in ama ngel khu vaihawmpa leh hunkhepa hikhawm dingin asawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Mosi in Izipt gam a tuipisan leh gamdai ah kum sawmli sung sillamdang leh chiemtenate abawl nuain amauh apuidohta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Israel tate kunga, Mangpa na Pasian un na unaute lah a kipat in Keima bangbang guolnei khat noute adingin ahing piengsah dinga, Ama thu na ngaikhe ding uhi, chipa khu tam Mosi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Gamdai a hattuomte lah a umpa, Sinai muol tunga vansawlsiengin ahoupipa leh ipu ipate kunga umpa, eite kunga piehsawn ding a thu hingte lapa khu tam Mosi mama ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />I ipu ipaten athu azui ut sih ua, anuol ua, tualeh Izipt gam alunggul kia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Amauten Aaron kungah, hing pui dingin pasiente hing bawlpiehin, Izipt gam a kipat a hing puidohpa Mosi lah atanchin ka thei nawn sih uhi, achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tua hun lai mama in bawngnou lim akibawl ua, tua bawngnou lim ah kithoinate alan ua, amauh khut suohte tungah anuom ua, alungdamta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tuachi’n Pasian in amaute akiheisan a van a aasite be dingin aleengatsanta hi. Guolneite laibu ah tambangin akigiel hi. Aw Israel innkuonte, gamdai ah kum sawmli sungin, gantate that in kithoinate leh sillatte, na hing lan ngai uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Molek biehbuh (puon inn) leh na Pasian uh Remphan ahsi bieh dinga alim na kibawlte uh, na zawng kawi kawi zaw uhi. Tuaziehin ken noute Babilon, khuohen lam ah sal taang dingin, ka hing puimang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />“Ipu ipate un gamdai ah Theipina biehbuh anei uhi. Tuakhu Pasian in Mosi ahil bangbang leh ette ding a alim leh guong amu banga kibawl ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tuami biehbuh mama khu ipu ipate hahlesuonten aneiden ua, Joshua lamkaina nuoi ah Jentelte gam ah ahing polut uhi. Pasian in ipu ipate mai ah, tua Jentelte anawtdoh a, David khang dongin tua biehbuh azang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tua David in Pasian mitmuin deisahna anga a, Jakob Pasian tenna ding biehbuh bawlpieh ding angen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Hinanleh Solomon in tua inn alam zawta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Ahivang in Tungnungpen khu khuta kilam innte ah ateng sih hi; Guolnei in:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Van ka toupha ahia, leitung ka keng ngapna ahi a, Inn bangchibang na hing bawlpieh ding uoi? Mangpa’n achi hi, ahisihleh ka khawlna mun zong bang ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Tam silte zousie ka khutin abawl hilou amah? chia ana gen bangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />“Nou milungphengte leh genha, lungtang leh bil vuloute aw, na pu napate uh bawl bangin Hagau Siengthou na doudal ngitnget uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Na pu napate un guolneite laha koi ahiei abawlgenthei uh? Mi dihtahpa hing pei ding thu genlawhte athat ua, tua mi dihtahpa mansahte leh thatte khu noute mama na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Vansawlsiengte pieh sawn dan munapi a, zui loute aw,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Tam thute azah tah un, asintang uh akhoita a, Stephen khu ahagiel khumta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Hinanleh ama pen Hagau Siengthoua dimin, van lam a en a, Pasian thupina leh Pasian zietlam a Jesu ding amu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />“Ngai un, van kihongsa ka mu a, Pasian zietlam a Mihing Tapa ding zong ka mu hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaute Aw ngaitah in akikou ua, abil uh ahum ua, kithutuoh tahin apangkhawm ua, anot ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />khuo apat in adeldoh ua, suongin asep ua, tualeh atheipimite’n tangval khat amin Saul kengbul ah apuonte uh akoi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Tualeh, Stephen in, “Mangpa Jesu ka hagau na sangin chia ahat laiin suongin asep uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Tuachi’n akhupdin a, aw ngaitahin akikou a, “Mangpa tam akhelnate uah, amaute mawpai sin,” achi a, achi zouin a imuta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh Saul in zong Stephen shi khu pha asahpi hi. Tua hun laiin Jerusalem khuo a hattuom umte, nasatahin abawlgenthei panta ua, sawltahte chiloungal Judia leh Samaria gamte ah akithezah siengta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pasian a mi kipezou koite ahiei in Stephen avui ua, nahpitahin akap uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hinanleh Saul in hattuom pawlte asugenthei mama a, innchin ah alut a, numei pasal akaidoh a, suongkul ah akhum zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n akithezahte khu khochin ah apei ua thu agenta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n Philip khu Samaria khopi ah apeisuh a, akung uah Khrist thu agenta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mipi tampi in Philip thugen aza ua; chiemtena lamdang abawlte amu ua, lungsim munkhat puoin, angaikhie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Dawibuate aw ngaitah a kikouin mi tampi amatte sunga kipat in ahing pawt ua, tualeh zeng leh Kengbai tampi zong adam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh tua khopi ah lungnopna thupitah aumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hinanleh amin Simon kichi mi khat a um a, ama’n milien ka hi chiin tumasang lamin tua khopi ah mitphieldawi zangin Samaria mite lamdangsatahin ana koi leng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi zousie aneupen apat alienpen tandongin, “Tam mipa Pasian silbawltheina thupi ahi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aman mitphieldawi zang a hun sawtpi lamdangsataha ana koitah ziehin athu angaisah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hinanleh Philip in Pasian leenggam thu leh Jesu Khrist min agen khu, agintat tahun numei leh pasalten baptisma atangta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n Simon nangawnin zong agingta a, baptisma atan nuain Philip kungah a umden a, sillamdang leh chiemtena kibawlte mu in lamdang asa thei mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jerusalem khuo a um sawltahten Samariten Pasian thu a awita uh chi azah tah un akung uah Peter leh Johan asawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amautegel Samaria ava tunsuh tahun, Hagau Siengthou atan theina dingun thungetna anei pieh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aziehpen amaute lah a koima tungah Hagau Siengthou atung nai sih hi. Mangpa Jesu min a baptisma tang ahi bou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n Peter leh Johan in atung uah akhut uh anga ua, Hagau Siengthou atangta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh Simon in sawltahte khut ngah zieh a, Hagau Siengthou kipie ahi chi amu in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Tambanga thuneina kei zong hing pie un, koi tungah zong khut ka ngahna pouin, Hagau Siengthou atan theina dingun, chiin sum pieh asawmta hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hinanleh Peter in akungah, “Pasian silpieh dangka sum a lei na tup zieh in, na sum nangma toh mangkhawm heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pasian mitmu a na lungtang adihlou ziehin, tam thu ah panna na nei sih a, tan zong na nei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuaziehin tam gitlouna kisia inlen, Pasian kungah thungen in, tuachi’n na lungtanga na ngaituote ahing ngaidam kha maw sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aziehpen khatna sinkha leh gitlouna khainienga kankhawm na hi chi ka mu hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuachi’n Simon in adawnga, “Na sil gente uh ka tunga bangma atun louna dingin, nouman Mangpa kung ah thu hing ngetpieh un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuachi a, Peter leh Johan in theipina thu leh Mangpa thu agen zou un, Jerusalem khuo ah apei kiata ua, lampi ah Samaria gam a khuo tampi ah, khantanhoi agen kawm zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mangpa vansawlsieng khat in Philip ahoupi a, “Thou inlen simlam a, Jerusalem khuo akipat Gaza zotna lampi ah pei inlen, tua lampi khu gamdai tawnsuh peh ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuachi’n Philip athou a apeita hi. Tualeh Ngai vawi, Ethiopia mi khat, Ethiopia leengnu Kandaki nuoi a michilge thunei lientah agou zousie kempa ahia, Jerusalem khuo a Pasian be dinga va haw ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Apeikia lamin a sakolleng a toukawmin guolnei Isai laibu asim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuachi’n, Hagau in Philip kungah “Va pei inlen tua sakolleng va nai inlen,” kithuopi in achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuachi’n Philip khu akungah ava tai a, guolnei Isai laibu asim azata a, Philip in akungah, “Na laisim na theisiem ei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tualeh Ethiopia mipa’n “Koima hilchet louin bang kachi theisiem diei?” achi hi. Tualeh Philip a kaltou a akunga tou dingin achiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Laisiengthou asimna mun khu tami ahi: “Tha ding Belam kipeipi bangin, ama apeipi ua, Tualeh belamnou amulmette mai a, asip khinkhian bangin, Aman akam zong akeeh sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Akingiemkhieh laiin, Atunga thudih genna lahmang ahi a, Ahahlesuonte tanchin koiin ahing gen diei? Leitung a kipat ahinna lahpieh ahi ngal a,” chi khu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tuachi’n michilge in Philip ahoupi a, akungah “Tam thu guolneiin koi tungthu agenna ahiei? ama tungthu ahiei, ahisihleh midang khat tungthu?” ka hing dong ahi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tuachi’n Philip in akam akaah a, tua Laisiengthou apat in akungah Jesu tangthupha ahilta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tuabanga lampi a apei suh lai un, tui umna mun khat ahing tung ua, michilgein “En vawi, tanah tui a um hi, baptisma ka tanna ding bangin ahing dal ei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tuachi’n Philip in “Na lungtang zousie a na gintat leh na tang thei hi.” Tualeh aman adawnga, “Jesu Khrist khu Pasian Tapa ahi chi ka gingta hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tuachi’n a sakolleng khawldingin thu apie a, Philip leh michilge ani un tui sung ah apei suh ua, Philip in ama abaptista hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Amautegel tui akipat ahing peitou tahun, Mangpa Hagau in Philip alamangta a, michilgein ama amu nawn sih hi, tualeh michilge khu lampi ah nuomsa tahin apeita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Hinanleh Philip pen Azotus khuo ah amu uhi, tualeh aman Kaisaria khuo atun masangsie in apeina khochin ah khantanhoi thupha agenta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Saul in Mangpa nuazuite a vau thu leh tha atup thu genkhe kawmin, siempu lien kungah ava pei a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh Damaska khuo a kikhopna innte a pieh ding leh tami lampi zui pouma pasal hi in numei hitaleh amumu hensa a Jerusalem khuo a ahing pui theina ding lai angen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh azinkhie a, Damaska khuo atun kuon tahin, thakhat in van akipat in vah akimah ahing taang suat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n leiah apua a “Saul, Saul, nang bang dinga kei na hing bawlsiet ahiei?” chiin aw khat aza hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh aman “Mangpa koi na hiei?” achi hi. Tuachi’n “Mangpa’n adawnga, na bawlsietpa Jesu ka hi, kilna sia zum peh khu nanga ding in ahasa hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman chitun kawm leh lamdangsa tahin, Mangpa bang bawl dingin na hing dei ei? achi hi. Tualeh Mangpa’n akungah, Thou inlen khopi sungah lut in, tuachi’n na bawl ding hilin na um ding,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh ama toh zin khawmte khu gen ding thei louin ading den ua, aw ging pen aza ua, hinanleh koima amu sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n Saul khu leilah a kipat in athou a, amit aha leh Koima amu theisih hi. Hinanleh akhut in akai ua, Damaska khopi sungah apuilutta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n ni thum sung khomulouin a um a, bangma ne lou, bangma dawn louin a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Damaska khuo ah nuazui khat a um a, amin Anania ahi, tualeh Mangpa’n mengmuna a kilahin akungah, “Anania,” achi a, tualeh aman “Mangpa tanah ka um hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n akungah, “Kisa inlen gawlzing tang achi uah pei inlen, Juda inn a um, Tarsas kho mi, amin Saul kichipa va kandoh in, Ngai vawi, athunget laitah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh manglam bangin, mi khat amin Anania kichi hing lut a, akhomu theina dinga atunga khut ngain amuta hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n Anania in adawnga, “Mangpa tam mipa tungtang thu leh Jerusalem khuo a na misiengthoute tung a atatsiet dante mi tampi gen ka na zata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh tanah zong, Na min loute zousie mat a henna dingin siempu liente akipat in thuneina tawi a hing pei ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hinanleh Mangpa’n Anania kungah, “Ama Jentelte, leengte leh Israel tate kunga ka min polut dinga ka belguot ahi ziehin na va haw ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aziehpen ka min zieh a gentheina bangzata thuoh ding ahiei chi ama ka theisah ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n Anania ava pei a, inn ah alut a, atunga khut ngain, “Sanggampa Saul, na mit vahna ding leh Hagau Siengthou a na dim theina dingin, Mangpa na hing peina lampi a na kunga kilahpa Jesu ngel in a hing sawl ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh thakhat in amit apat in alip bang khat ahing kesuh a, khuo amu theita a, tuachi’n athoua baptisma atangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh ann ane a, atha ahatta hi. Tuachi’n Saul khu Damaska khuo a nuazui umte kungah ni tam kuomtah atam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aman kikhopna innte ah, “Jesu Pasian Tapa” ahidan thu atangkoupi pai ngal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n ama thugen za zousiein lamdang asa mama ua, “Tam mipa Jerusalem khuo a Jesu min loute tunga tatsepa hilou amah, tualeh tuabang mite man a hensa a siempu liente kunga pui tum a tam mun a hing pei hilou amah?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hinanleh Saul khu ahing hat semsem a, tam Jesu khu Khrist ahi chi ahilchien a, Damaska khuo a Juda umte gen ding theilouin akoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ni tampi nuain Judaten ama tha ding thu akidapkup uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hinanleh Saul in asiltup uh ana thei hi. Tualeh amauten ama tha tumin khopi kotpi tengah sun leh zanin abuh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuachi’n nuazuiten ama azawpi ua zanlai in kulbang tunga kipat bawm lienpi khat in akhaikhe suh ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tualeh Saul Jerusalem a ahing tuntahin nuazuite lah ah tel asawm a, hinanleh amaun nuazui khat hi tahtah dinga agintat lou zieh un, abawn un agiing chiet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hinanleh Barnaba in ama azawpi a sawltahte kungah apeipi hi, Lampi a Mangpa amu dan leh Mangpa’n ama ahoupi dante, tualeh Damaska khuo a Jesu min a hangsantah a thu agen dante, amaute kungah agenta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuachi’n Saul zong Jerusalem khuo ah, lut zel pawt zelin amaute toh a umkhawmta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mangpa Jesu min in hangsan tahin thu agen a, tualeh Greek ham zang Judate akinielpi hi, hinanleh amaun ama tha atum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua thu unauten athei tahun, Kaisaria khuo ah apui suh ua, Tarsas khuo ah asawldohta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuachi’n hattuomte khu Judia gam, Galili gam leh Samaria gam zousie ah muonna anga ua, adet deu deu uhi. Tualeh Mangpa zaudan siem in, Hagau Siengthou hamuonin a um ua, ahing pung deudeuta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuin tambang ahing hi a, Peter khu gingtute lah ah avah kawikawi a, Lidda khuo a misiengthou umte kungah zong apei suh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Khunah aman amin Ainia kichi mi khat azenga, kum giet lupna a lumden amu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tualeh Peter in akungah, “Ainia Jesu Khrist in ahing damsah hi; thou inlen, na netpha ziel in” achi hi. Tuachi’n ama athou pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tuachi’n Lidda leh Sharon phaijanga tengte zousie in ama amu ua, Mangpa lam angata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Joppa khuo ah amin Tabitha kichi nuazui khat a um hi. Tabitha min akhiehna Dorkas ahi. Tam numei pen nna hoi sem leh hepina silbawl ahau mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Hinanleh khum hun laiin, ahing china a, ashita hi, aluong asil zou un, inndan tungnungah asiel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tualeh Lidda khuo khu Joppa khuo toh kinai ahi a, nuazuiten Lidda khuo ah Peter a um chi athei ua, sawt hallou a akung ua “Hing pei pai dinga va gen dingin mi ni asawl uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tuachi’n Peter adingdoh a amautegel toh akizawh khawmta uhi. Ahing tun tahin ama khu inndan tungnung ah apuitou ua, tualeh meithaite zousie Peter kungah dingin akap ua, Dorkas in adam lai a amaute a dinga puonah leh puon abawlpiehte alah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Hinanleh Peter in amaute zousie apawtsah a, akhupdin a, thu angenta hi, tualeh mishi luong lam ngain “Tabitha thou in” achi hi. Tualeh amanu amit ahing hah a, Peter amu tahin ahing touta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tuachi’n Peter in akhut ahah a, akaithouta hi, tualeh misiengthoute leh meithaite ahan a, hingdam in apeta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tualeh tua thu Joppa khuo a mi zousie in athei ua, mi tampi in Mangpa agingta ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tuachi’n Peter Joppa khuo a Savun bawlpa Simon inn ah ni tampi atamta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kaisaria khuo ah amin Kornelia kichi mi khat a um a, Itali pawl achi ua galkap zahoutu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pasian ngaisahmi ahia, a innkuonpite zousie toh Pasian giing mi ahi ua, mite kungah kiphal tahin hepina silpieh ape leeng hi, tualeh Pasian kungah zong thu angen ngitnget hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nitah lam khat, nai thum ding velin mengmuna kichientahin, Pasian vansawlsieng khat akunga hing lut a, “Kornelia,” chiin amu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kornelia in ama a en a, azauta a, “Bang ahiei Mangpa?” achi hi. Tuachi’n vansawlsiengin akungah “Na thungetnate leh na sil piehte theizing dingin Pasian masang ah ahing tungtouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuin Joppa khuo ah mi sawl inlen, Simon Peter va han sah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama tuipi gei a um, savun bawlpa Simon inn a tung ahi; aman na bawl ding ahing hil ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh Kornelia houpi vansawlsieng khu apeizou tahin, Kornelia in ainnsunga nasem asuohte ni leh ama venga umte lah akipat Pasian adinga kipumpieh galkap khat ahan a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amaute kunga thu umdan teng ahilchien zou in Joppa khuo ah asawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Azing ni a apei lai un, tualeh khopi atunding kuon un, Peter khu thungen dingin inntung ah akaltou a, sun nai sawmleni hun vel ahi a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Peter agil ahing kiel a, bang ahiei khat neh a ut hi; hinanleh neh ding abawl lai un, mengmu bangin ahing um a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh van ahing kihonga, bang ahiei puon bawm lientah bang, aningli a kikhi a leitunga hing kikhaikhesuh amu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua bawm sungah, leitunga kengli nei ganhing namkim, gamsate leh ganhing bohvahte leh tungleeng vate a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh aw khat in akungah, “Peter thou inlen, gou inlen ne in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hinanleh Peter in, “Hilou e, Mangpa; Ken asienglou leh abua mawngmawng bangma ka ne ngai sih hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh aw in ani veina dingin ama ahoupi a, “Pasian in asuhsiengthousa, nang sienglou na chi teitei ding ahi sih,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuabangin thumvei ahing um a, tuachi’n bawm khu van ah akilatou kiata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Peter in tam amengmu khu bang genna adiei chia lamdangsa kawm a angaituo buoi laiin, Ngai vawi, Kornelia mi sawlten, Simon inn akandohta ua, kotkhah bul ah ading uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh amauten ahan ua, Simon amin khem Peter kichipa tuana atun leh tunlou ana dong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Peter in mengmuna asil mu khu, angaituo tuo laiin Hagau in akungah, “Ngai in, mi thum in ahing sui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuaziehin thou inlen, kumsuh inlen, bangma ginglel louin amaute zui in, amaute keima hing sawl ahi uh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n Peter khu Kornelia hing sawl mite kungah apeisuh a, akung uah, “Na mi suipa uh Keima ka hi, nang peina uh azieh bang ahiei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh amaun galkap zahoutupa “Kornelia midihtat Pasian zaudan siem mi Juda nam zousiete lah a minphatna neipa kungah, Pasian akipat vansawlsieng khat in ama ahoupi a, ama inn a haw dinga nang hing hansah ding leh na thugen ngaikhe dingin ahil hi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaute ahanlut a, agieh sahta hi. Tualeh azingni in, Peter amaute toh azawhkhawma, tualeh Joppa khuo a unau koite ahiei in zong ama azui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh athai ni in Kaisaria khuo ahing tungta uhi. Tualeh Kornelia in amaute ana ngah a, ahieng asante leh alawm aguol ngaite ana hankhawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Peter ahing lut kuon in, Kornelia in ana vaidawn a, akengbul ah khupboh in Pasian bieh bangin ana bie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hinanleh Peter in ama akaithou a, “Dingin, kei zong mihing ka hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tualeh Peter ama toh kihoulim kawm in inn sungah alut a, mi tampi um khawm amuta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaute kungah, “Juda mi adingin nam dangte toh kipawl a, kive tuo asieng sih chi na theisa uh ahi. Hinanleh mi koima asienglou leh abua ka chi ding ahi sih chi, Pasian in ahing theisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuazieh in na hing hat tahun niel sese louin ka hing pei pai hi, tuin na hing hatna zieh uh bang ahiei? chi ka hing dong ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuachi’n Kornelia in, “Ni li peita in, tu bang hun in ka inn sungah ann ka ngawl a, nitah lam nai thum hun vel in thu ka ngen a, tualeh Ngai vawi, mi khat puonvam silin ka masangah ahing ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Kornelia na thungetna zahin a umta, na hepina silpiehte zong Pasian in athei ngitnget hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuaziehin Joppa khuo ah mi sawl inlen, Simon Peter kichipa han sahin Ama tuipi gei a teng savun bawlpa Simon inn a tung a hi. Ama ahing tun chiengin, na kungah thu agen ding hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuaziehin na kungah mi ka hing sawl pai hi, na hing pei ahoi ahi. Tuaziehin tuin Pasian in na kunga ahing thupieh zousie ngai dingin, Pasian mai ah ka unpi un tanah ka um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tuachi’n Peter in thu agen a, “Pasian in mi deisah tuom anei sih, chi dihtahin ka theita hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Hinanleh namchin lah a Ama giing a, dihtattah a gamta pouma Ama dingin pomtah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Pasian in Israel tate kunga, a thu vaihah, Jesu Khrist tungtawna lungmuonna thu agen khu. Jesu khu mi zousie Mangpa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tua thu khu, Johan in atangkoupi baptisma nua in, Galili gam akipat in ahing thang pan a, Judia gam zousie ah athang suoh a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Pasian in Hagau Siengthou leh silbawltheina toh Nazareth Jesu sathau anu dan, Pasian in a umpi ziehin ama silhoi bawlin leh dawiin asuhgenthei zousie damsahin apei kawi hi chi nouten na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tualeh Judate gam leh Jerusalem khuo a, asil bawl zousie theipite ka hi uhi, Judaten singdawn ah Ama akhai ua athatta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ama khu Pasian in nithum niin akaithou kia a, mite mu dingin chientah in akilang sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Mi zousie kungah hilou in, Pasian in theipimi hi ding a atel koute kungah, akilah hi. Koute pen mishi lah a athawkia nua a, ama toh nekhawm a, dawnkhawmte ka hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tualeh Ama khu mihing leh mishite tunga thukhen dinga Pasian guot ahi chi, mite kunga tangkoupi ding leh theisah dingin Pasian in koute thu ahing pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Koipou Ama gingta ten Ama min ziehin khelnate ngaidamna amu ding uh, chi guolnei zousie’n ana theisah sa uh ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Peter in tam thute agen laitahin, athu za zousie tungah Hagau Siengthou ahing tungta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tualeh Peter hing zui teptante lah a gingtuten, Jentelte tung nangawn a Hagau Siengthou silthawnpieh sunbuoh a um amu tah un lamdang asa mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Aziehpen amaute ham tuom tuom a ham a, Pasian phat in azata uhi. Tuachi’n Peter in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />“Tam mite eima tan bangbang Hagau Siengthou tang mite tui a baptisma tan ding koi in akham thei diei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa min a baptisma tang dingin amaute thu apie hi. Tuachi’n amauten ni tamlou sung tam tadi nalai dingin ama ahouta uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuin Judia gam a sawltahte leh unau umten Jentelten zong Pasian thu apomta uh chi azata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh Peter Jerusalem a ahing tuntou tahin, teptante lah a gingtuten Peter ana kinielpi uh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Nang teptanlou mite lah ah na va haw a, amaute toh na ne khawm hi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hinanleh Peter in sil umdan abul akipat aban banin akung uah ahilchien hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Joppa khuo a thungen a ka um laiin, mengmu bangin ka um a, manglam bangin puon bawm lienpi bang aningli a kikhi, van akipat a hing kikhaikhesuh ka mu a, ka kungah ahing tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua khu ka en kilkel a ka ngaituo a, leitunga ganhing kengli neite, gamsate, ganhing bohvahte leh tunga leeng vate, ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh aw khat ka za a, ka kungah Peter thou inlen, gou inlen, nein, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanleh ken, hilou e Mangpa, asienglou leh abua mawngmawng bangma ka kam ah bangchih laiin zong alut ngai sih hi ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hinanleh van akipat aw in, Pasian in asuhsiengsa nang sienglou chi sin, ahing chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hichibang ngen thum vei ahing um a, tua zouin van lam ah akikhaitou kiata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua hun laitah in, mi thum Kaisaria apat a ka kunga ahing sawl uh, ka umna inn mai ah ana ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n Hagau in bangma ginglel loua amaute zui dingin ahing hil hi. Tuathamlouin tam sanggam guh ten zong ahing zui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh aman ka kungah, a inn sunga Vansawlsieng vading amu dan leh, vansawlsiengin akunga Joppa khuo ah mi sawl inlen, amin Simon Peter kichipa hansah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aman thu ahing hil dinga, tua thu in nang leh na innkuonpite hundam in na um ding uh, achi dan zong ahing hil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachia thu ka gen pat leh, Hagau Siengthou itung ua ahing tun chiil lai mabangin, atung uah ahing tungta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa thugen, Johan in tuiin ahing baptis a, hinanleh nouten Hagau Siengthouin baptisma na hing tang ding uh, achi khu ka theidohta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaziehin eiten Mangpa Jesu Khrist igintat ua Pasian in ahing pieh tua silpieh bangbang amaute kunga apieh nuain Pasian niel viel ding kei leltah koi ka hiei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amauten tam thute azah tahun, asipta ua, Pasian aphat zawta uhi. “Tuachi’n Pasian in Jentelte zong hing dingin kisia a lungheisah ata ve maw,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuin Stephen abawlsiet zieh ua tai thangte khu Phoinisia gamte, Saipras gamte leh Antiok khuo tan dongin azin ua, Judate chilou koima kung ah thu agen sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hinanleh alah ua mi pawl khatte pen Saipras leh Sairin khuo a mite ahi ua, tua miten Antiok khuo atun un, Greek mite kungah thu agen ua, Antiok ah Jesu Khrist khantanhoi thu ahilta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mangpa khut in amaute a umpi a, tualeh mi tampiin agingta ua, Mangpa lam angata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuachi’n tam thute Jerusalem khuo a um hattuomten azata ua, tualeh Antiok tandong va haw ding in Barnaba asawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ama ava tun tahin Pasian khotuona amu a, akipah mama a, alungtang zousie ua kukal tah a, Mangpa a gin um zing dingin amaute ahantawhta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Aziehpen ama mi hoitah ahia, Hagau Sienthou leh ginna a dim ahi. Tuachi’n mi tamtah Mangpa lam ah akibelapta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuachi’n Barnaba khu Saul sui dingin Tarsas khuo lam zuon in akuonkheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tualeh Barnaba in Saul amu tahin, Antiok khuo ah ahing zawpi hi. Tualeh hichi ahing hi a, kum khat sung hattuomte toh akikhawm ua, mi tampi thu ahil uhi. Tualeh Antiok khuo a nuazuite khu Khristian akichi masa pen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tualeh tua hun lai in, guolnei pawlkhat Jerusalem khuo akipat in Antiok khuo ah ahing haw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuachi’n alah ua mi khat amin Agabus kichipa adingdoh a, leitung pumpi ah kiel tung ding ahi chi’n Hagau hil in, atheisahta a, tua kiel khu Klaudia Kaisar hun lai in ahing tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuachi’n nuazuiten angapdan chiet un, Judia gam a unau umte kungah panpina hah a sawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua bangin abawl pai ngal ua, Barnaba leh Saul khut ah, upate kungah ahahta uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua hun lai in leengpa Herod in hattuom pawlte bawlsiet tumin akhut ahata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n Johan sanggampa Jakob khu namsauin athatta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh tam asilbawlten Judate akipahsah chi a mu ziehin, Peter zong mat asawm nalai hi. Tua hun khu tanghou tolsawlou pawi hunlai ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachia Peter amat tahin suongkul ah akhum a, galkap lili a kipawl pawl li in aveng sah a, peikan pawi zou chienga mipite kunga puidoh a sawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaziehin Peter suongkul ah akoi tadi a, hinanleh ama a dingin hattuomten Pasian kungah tawlnga louin thu angen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Herod in apuidoh ding ni, zanlai in Peter khu galkap ni kikaal ah khainieng ni a hensa in a imu hi, tualeh veng miten zong kotkhah bul a dingin suongkul aveng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ngai vawi, Mangpa vansawlsieng khat akungah ahing dinga, suongkul sungah vah ahing taangta a, vansawlsiengin Peter pang bengin aphawng a, “Kintahin thou in,” achi a, tualaitahin asia khainieng bute akhut apat aketa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n vansawlsiengin akungah, “Na kawng gah inlen, na kedap but in,” achi hi. Aman tuabang in abawlta hi. Tualeh vansawlsiengin akungah “Na puon sil inlen hing zui in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n Peter apawta, azuita hi; vansawlsieng silbawl khu atahtah ahilam athei sih a, mengmu akisa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Vengmite dinna mun khatna leh nina apel nua un, khopi lutna sia kotpi atungta uhi; tua kotpi khu amaute gel a dingin ama leh ama ahing kihong a, tuachi’n apawt ua, gawlzing khat azui lai un, vansawlsiengin thakhat in apeisanta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Peter ahing khophawh bepin, “Mangpa’n vansawlsieng ahing sawl a, Herod khut leh Juda mite kinepna zousie akipat in ahing hundohta chi ka theichienta” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n tua sil angaituo nua in, John Mak nu Mari inn ah ava pei a, tuanah mi tampi thungetna neiin ana umkhawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Peter in kotkhah akiu tahin, amin Rhoda ki chi nungah khat adawng dingin ahing pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Peter aw ahi chi athei tahin, akipah seng ziehin kot hong louin innsung lam ah atailut a, Peter kot khah bul ah ading hi, chiin ava gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amaun akungah, “Amo na hita,” achi uhi. Hinanleh amanu’n atahtah ahi, achi tei tei hi. Tuachi’n amauten “Vansawlsieng hiva” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Peter in kot akiu kiu nalai a, tualeh kot ahon tahun, ama amu ua, lamdang asa mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hinanleh Peter in amaute sip dingin akhutzap a, Mangpa’n suongkul apat ama apuidoh dan amaute ahilta hi. Aman “Pei unlen tam thute Jakob leh asanggamte kungah va hil un,” achi hi. Tuachi’n apawt a mundangah apeita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n zingmawng ahing hitah in, Peter hei a um ahiei chiin galkapte buoi chitahin abuoita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Herod in Peter asui a, amulou tahin avengmite a endih a, tha dingin thu apeta hi. Herod pen Judia gam akipat Kaisaria khuo ah apeisuh a khunah a umden ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuin Herod khu Tai-ar leh Sidon khomite tungah alungthah mama a, hinanleh agam miten tua leengpa gam a kipat neh leh dawn la zel ahiziehun kithutuoh tahin ahing pei ua, leengpa inn sung vaisaipa Blastus lawmbawl in kilemna ngen in a kungah ahing pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n ani chiem ni in, Herod in aleengpuon sil in aleengtoupha tungah atou a, akung uah thu agen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh mipite akikou ua, “Tam pen pasien aw ahi, mihing aw ahisih,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Herod in Pasian thupina apieh lou ziehin, Mangpa vansawlsieng khat in asat a, hutin ane a ashita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hinanleh Pasian thu pen akhang semsem a, apung zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tualeh Barnaba leh Saul in anasep uh azaw tahun Jerusalem apat akile kia ua Johan amin tah Mak kichipa azawpi uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Antiok khuo a hattuom umte lah ah, guolneite leh thuhil siete a um uhi: Amaute khu Barnaba, Nigar kichi Simeon, Sairin khuo a mi Lusia, vaihawmpa Herod toh khang khawm Manaen leh Saul te ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amaute Mangpa nasem a ann ngawl a aumlaiun, Hagau Siengthou in, “Barnaba leh Saul amaute ka hatna zieh sem dingin, kei a dingin hing setuompieh un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n ann ngawl a thungetna anei zou un, Barnaba leh Saul tungah akhut uh anga ua, asawlkheta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n Hagau Siengthou in asawldoh bangin Seliusie khuo ah apeisuh ua, tuana kipat in Saipras lam zuonin kuongin apeita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh Salamis khuo atuntahun Judate kikhopna innte ah Pasian thu agen uhi. Amaun Johan zong amauh panpi dingin azawpi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuin Saipras tuikul gam tuonsuohin Paphos khuo ah atung ua, khunah dawisiem guolnei tahlou, Juda mi khat atuoh kha ua, amin Bar Jesu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua mipa pen, gam uhpa Sergius Paulus mi piltah khat nasem a akunga um ahi, tua gam uhpa’n Pasian thu azah ut ziehin Saul leh Barnaba ahansah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanleh dawisiem Elima in, (Elima pen ama uh ham a Bar-Jesu min khiehna ahi) gam uhpa’n gintatlousah tumin, amaute ana doudal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n Saul (Paul zong akichi hi) Hagau Siengthou a dimin Elim a a ensaalden a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Aw nang milepchie leh hoilouna chintenga dimpa, nang dawimangpa tapa, nang dihtatna zousie melmapa, Mangpa lampi tangtahte heikawi tawplou ding na hiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ngai in, tuin Mangpa khut na tungah ahing tuta hi, na mit ataw dinga bangtan ahiei ni vah mu louin na um ding” achi hi. Tuachi’n thakhat in, tuimei bang miel atungah ahing kie a, akhut a; kai ding mi suiin akimai kawita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n gam uhpa’n tua sil kibawl amu tahin Mangpa tungtang thu kihilna lamdangsain agingta ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n Paul khu alawite toh Paphos khuo apat in apei ua, Pamphilia gam a Perga khuo ahing tung ua, tualeh Johan in amauh nuasiein Jerusalem ah akinuale kiata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hinanleh amaute Perga khuo akipat in Pisidia gam a Antiok khuo atung ua, tualeh khawlni in kikhopna inn ah alut ua, atou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Dan laibu leh guolneite laibu asim zou un, kikhopna inn vaihawmte’n amauh achiel ua, “Mite leh unaute aw, mipite a ding hanthawnna thu gen ding na nei uleh gen un,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n Paul adingtou a, amaute akhutzapa, “Israel mite leh nou Pasian zaudan siem mite aw, ngai un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tam Israel mite Pasian in ipu ipate ana tel a, Izipt gam a mikhuol banga ataam lai un, amaute atawisanga, aban thahat in apuidoh kia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kum sawm li sung vingveng gamdai a, agamtatna uh ana thuoh teitei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh Kanaan gam a nam sagite asuhmang zouin, agam uh, ama ua dingin ahawm piehta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuami nuain kum zali leh kum sawm nga sung vaihawm mite apie a, guolnei Samuel hun chieng dongin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuami nuain leeng khat ana ngen ua, tuachi’n Pasian in Benjamin nam a mi khat Kish tapa Saul apie a, aman kum sawmli sung vai ahawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh ama a lahdoh nuain aleengpa dingun David atungdoh ta hi; Pasian in tua mipa thu theipi in, Jesse tapa David ka lungtang bang puo mi ka mudohta, aman ka deilam abawl ding, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tam David hahlesuonte lah ah Pasian in athuchiemsa dungzuiin Israelte kungah Hundampa Jesu atung dingta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Jesu ahing tun masangin Johan in Israelmi zousie kungah Kisiana baptisma ana hil masata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Johan in anasep azaw kuon lai in, nouten kei koi hi dingin na hing ngaituo uoi? Ama hilou ka hi. Hinanleh ngai un, ka nua ah mi khat hing pei ding ahi, Kei pen akedap khau sutpieh taah zong ka hi sih hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Mite leh Abraham hahlesuon ka sanggamte leh na lah ua Pasian giing Jentelte aw, na kung uah tam hundamna thu ahing kihah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Jerusalem khuo a tengte leh avaihawmte un Jesu ana theilou zieh un, ahisihleh khawlni chin a asim khiet uh guol neite thugente theilou in Ama siemlou tangsah in, tua thute ana tang tungsahta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Amauten ashina ding khop azieh atungah bangma mu sihnan u’leh zong, Pilat kungah tha dingin angen teitei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Amaun atungtang thu na kigielsa zousie asuhtangtun nua un, singdawn akipat Ama alakhie ua, han ah asielta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hinanleh Pasian in mishi lah akipat Ama akaithou kiata a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tualeh amatoh Galili gam akipat a Jerusalem khuoa apeipitoute kungah ni tampi sung akilah hi; tua mite khu mite kunga athu theipi mite ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tualeh Kouten zong ipu ipate uh kunga ana chiemsa, tua khantan hoi kipah huoi ka hing hil uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Pasian in Jesu akaithou kiana tungtawn in, tua thuchiem ei a tate adingin atangtungsahta hi. Late nina ah zong: Nang ka tapa na hi a, tuni in kang hingkheta hi, chia gel bangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Muotna mun a kilekia nawnlou dinga, Pasian in Ama mishi lah akipat akaithaw thu tambangin agen hi: David kunga guolzawlna Siengthou leh, muonhuoi kachiem, Nangma ka hingpe ding hi, chiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tuaziehin Aman late dang khat ah, tambangin agiel hi, Nang na misiengthoupa khu, amuotmang ding na phal sih ding hi, achi kia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Aziehpen David in Pasian deina banga ama khanga mite adinga nna asep zouin ashi a apu apate kungah akivui a amuot mangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Hinanleh Pasian in akaithoupain muotmangna amu sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tuaziehin ka unaute aw, theiun, tam Jesu tungtawn a khelna ngaidamna thu noute kunga gen ka hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tualeh koipou agingta pouma khu, Mosi dan a siem natan zou louna uh sil zousie a kipat siemtansahin a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tuaziehin pilvang un, tuachilouin guolneite laibu a thu kigen na tung uah ahing tung kha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Nou mi simmaw hatte en un, lamdangsa unlen, Mangthai un; Aziehpen na damsungun, nna khat ka sem a, tua nasep khu noute hing kihil nanleh, na gingta vawtsih ding uhi, chiin ana gen uhi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Kikhopna inn apat Paul leh Barnaba apawtdoh laiun khawlni kia chienga tam thute gen nalai dingin mipiten angen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Mipi kikhawmte akikhenzah tahun, Judate tampi leh Juda biehdan zui Pasian a kipumpieh lah a mi tampi in Paul leh Barnaba azui ua, Paul leh Barnaba in amauh ana ahoupi ua, Pasian hepina a um ngitnget dingin amauh ahantawh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tualeh khawlni kia in, khopi sunga mi zousie akhojang phiel un Pasian thu ngaikhe dingin ahing kikhawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Hinanleh Judaten mipite amu tah un, thangsietna in adim ua, Paul thugen akal ua, agensie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tuachi’n Paul leh Barnaba in hangsan tahin agen uhi. “Noute kunga Pasian thu gen masah ding mawng ahi a, hinanleh nouten na nial ziehun, kumtawn hinna tang taahlou a na kibawl ziehun, ngai un, Jentelte lam ka ngat a uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangpa’n koute tambangin thu ahing pie hi: Jentelte adinga vah hiding leh, kawlmong donga hundamna tun dingin, ka hing guot hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Jentelten tam thu azah tahun akipah sengseng ua Mangpa thu atawisang uhi. Tualeh kumtawn a hing dinga guot taphot in agingta ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa thu khu tua gamkai pumpi ah adalzahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Hinanleh Judaten tua khopi a Pasian a kipumpieh leh numei zatat huoite leh khopi sunga mipi lamkaite achiilsie ua, Paul leh Barnaba abawlsie ua, agam ua kipat anotdoh sahta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Tuachi’n Paul leh Barnaba in akephang tung ua leivui bangte athingkhie ua, Ikonium khuo ah apeita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Tualeh nuazuite khu lungnopna leh Hagau Siengthou in adimta uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ikonium khuo a Judate kikhopna inn ah Paul leh Barnaba alut khawm ua, thu agen ua, tuachi’n Judate leh Greekte mi tamtahin agingta ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hinanleh agingta lou Judaten Jentelte achiilsie ua, unaute gel muda dingin alungsim uh asuhsietpiehta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa min suongin hangsantah a thu gen in hun sawtpi aum uhi, Ama’n chiemtenate leh sil lamdangte akhut ua bawlsah in, A hepina thu atheisah zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hinanleh khopi sung a mite akilangkhenta ua, pawlkhatten Judate lam apanpi ua pawldang khatten sawltahte lam apanpi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jentelte leh Judaten avaihawmte u’toh kithuo a zumhuoi taha bawla suonga selup atup lai un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amaun tam thu ana thei ua, Likaonia gam a Listra leh Derbe khuote leh akimvel gamte ah ataita ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuanah khantanhoi agenta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh Listra khuo ah kengbai koi ahiei mi khat thahatna neilou in atou a, apien chiil apat kengbai mawng ahia, akengin apei ngai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua mipan Paul thugen lunglut tahin angaikhie hi. Tualeh Paul in ama hoitah in a ensaal a, damna ding khop ginna a nei hi, chi athei hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aw ngaitahin, “Na kengin ding tangin,” achi a, tuachi’n ama akitawm a, akengin apeita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Paul sil bawl mipiten amu tah un, aw ngaitahin akikou ua, “Likaonia ham in pasiente mihing mel pua a ikung ua hing kum suh ahi uh,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amaute’n Barnaba khu Zeus achi ua, Paul pen thugenpipen ahi ziehin Hermis achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n khopi mai a um Zeus biehinn siempupa’n bawngtalte leh pahkhite kotpi bul ah ahing tawi a, mipite toh amaute gel mai ah kithoina bawl asawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hinanleh sawltahte Barnaba leh Paul in tam thu a zah tah un, apuonsilte uh abotkeh ua, mipite lah ah kikou pumin atailut ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Pute, bangding a tam silte bawl na hi uoi? koute zong noute piendan banga mihing ka hi bou uhi, tambang pannabei sil na bawlte ua kipata hing kihei a, van leh lei, tuisuogiet leh asunga sil um zousie siempa Pasian hing kunga na hing kihei theina ding un, khantanhoi ka hing tut uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aman khanglui laiin namchin amauh ut bang chiet a agamtat ding uh ana phal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahivang in Ama theipina panglouin ana umsah sih a, silhoi bawl in van akipat guotuite leh louhai gaphate ahing pie a, ilungtangte uh neh ding ann leh kipahnain adimsah hi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh tam thute gen in, amaute kunga kithoina bawl lou dingin akham zou hamham uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n Antiok leh Ikonium khuo akipat Juda koite ahiei khunah ahing haw ua, mipite athuzaw ua, tuachi’n Paul khu suongin asep ua, ashi hitava achi ziehun, khopi pulam ah akaikhie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahivang in nuazuite akim a ahing peikhawm lai un, ahing thou a khopi sungah ahing lut kiata hi; tualeh azing ni’n Barnaba toh Derbe lam ah apeita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh amauten Derbe khuo ah khantan hoi agen ua mi tampi ahil zou un, Listra leh Ikonium tualeh Antiok ah akinuale kiata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Gim gentheina tampi thuoh in Pasian leenggam ilut ding mawng ahi chiin nuazuite hinna hagau akhausah uhi. Ginna a umden dingin ahantawh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hattuom chin ah upate aguot ua, ann ngawl a athum nua un, amuon uh Mangpa kungah amaute akemsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Pesidia gam atotsuoh nua un, Pamphilia ah ahing tung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Perga khuo a thu agen zou un Attalia khuo ah apei suh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Attalia khuo akipat in Antiok zuon in kuongin apei ua, hattuom ten Pasian hepina sunga amaute akepsah ua, anasep zousa uh sem dinga aguotna uh Antiok khuo ahing tungta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tualeh ahing tun un hattuomte ahankhawm ua, Pasian in amaute zanga asil bawl zousie leh Pasian in Jentelte dinga ginna kot ahon pieh dante ahil uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuachi’n nuazuite toh hun sawtpi a um khawmta uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n mi koite ahiei Judia gam akipat in, ahing hawsuh ua, “Mosi dan dungzui a tep na tan sih uleh, hundam na hi thei sih ding uhi chiin unaute ahil uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuaziehin Paul leh Barnaba amaute toh lungthah a kiniel a akisel ziehun, Paul leh Barnaba khu alah ua koite ahiei toh, tam thu toh kisai a Jerusalem a sawltahte leh upate kunga va haw tou ding in aguot uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n hattuomten asawlkhie ua, amauten Phoinisia gam leh Samaria gam atotna uah, Jentelte hing kihei dan agen ua, tuami’n unaute nasatahin akipahsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh Jerusalem khuo atuntahun, Hattuomte leh, sawltahte, tualeh upate’n ana kipahpi ua, tualeh amaun Pasian in amauh zanga, asil bawlte zousie ahil uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hinanleh Pharisaite lah a gingtu pawlkhat adingdoh ua, “Jentelten tep atan ua, Mosi dan azui uh kul ahi, “achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n Sawltahte leh upate tam thu ngaituo dingin akikhawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh nasatah a akiniel nua un, Peter adingdoh a, akung uah, “Unaute aw, Jentelten keima kam a khantanhoi azah ua, agintat na ding ua, Pasian in hun peisa lai a, ilah ua pat kei ahing tel dan na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n lungtang theipa Pasian in eite ahing pieh bangin Hagau Siengthou akung uah apie a, atheipita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aman eite leh amaute khentuom neilou in, ginna ziehin alungtangte uh asiengthou sahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n ipu ipate hihen, eite hita lei, ipuoh zoulou hahkol bangdinga nuazuite ngawnga baat a, Pasian ze et sawm na hi uoi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hinanleh amaute mabangin, eite zong Mangpa Jesu Khrist hepina zieh a hundam ding hiin, ikigingta uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n mipi zousie asipta ua, Barnaba leh Paul in, Pasian in amaute zanga, Jentelte lah a chiemtenaleh sillamdang abawl thute agen uh angaikhie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amaute asip dide laitah un Jakob in thu agen a; “Unaute aw, ka thugen Ngai un:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pasian in Ama min paw dinga Jentelte lah apat mite lahdoh dingin, Jentelte ave masa hi chi thu Simon in agenta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh tam thu leh guolneite thu akituoh lien a, tambangin akigiel hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tamte nua chiengin ka hing kinuale kia dinga, achimsa David puonbuh ka lamtha dinga, asietnate ka bawl kia dinga, tuachi’n ka tungding ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n midangte leh, Jentel ka min a kihan zousiete nangawn in, Pasian asuina dingun, Tam silte zousie bawlpa, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A silbawlte zousie leitung kisiem chiil apat Pasian thei ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuaziehin Jentelte lah a Pasian lam a hing kiheite pen subuoi dalei chi ka ngaidan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Milim biehna, sil bua nehte, kingaina siengloute, hehlup sa leh sisan nehte, tawpsan dingin akung uah, lai giel lei ka chi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Aziehpen ni danglai a pat in Mosi dan kho tengah akigen a, khawlni simsiel in kikhopna inn teng a kisim ahi zieh in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuachi’n sawltahte leh upate leh hattuom zousiein alah ua mi tel a, Paul leh Barnaba toh Antiok khuo a sawl dingin pha asa ua, atelte uh min khu Judas amin dang Barsaba kichipa leh Silas ahi ua, amaute khu unaute lah a lamkaite ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amauten tambangin laihah agiel uhi: “Sawltahte, upate leh na sanggamte un, Antiok khuo leh, Siria leh Silisia gam a um, Jentel unaute kungah, chibai ka hing buh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Koute lah a mi pawlkhat noute kunga, hing pei in, tep na tan ding uh, Dan na zui ding uh ahi, chi a, athugente un, noute ahing lungbuoi sah uhi, chi thu ka na za uhi. Tuabang thu gen dingin, amaute thu ka pe kha sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuabanga lungsim mun khat puo a ka kikhop tah un mi teldoh a, ka it tah uh Barnaba leh Paul,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mangpa Jesu Khrist min a ahinna uh phalte gel toh na kung ua hing sawl dingin pha kasa uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuaziehin Judas leh Sailas ka hing sawl uhi, amauten zong tam thute kam in ahing gen ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Aziehpen, Hagau Siengthou leh kouten, Tam thu poimawte chilou puohgih dang bangma na tung ua hing guonlou hoi kasa uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Milim mai a kithoina sa nehte, sisan nehte, hehlup sa nehte leh kingaina thanghuoite tawpsan u’lachin nou a dingin ahoi ding hi. Mangpha, chiin agiel uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuabanga sawl ahibang un, amaute Antiok khuo atung ua, tuachi’n mipi ahankhawm ua, laihah khu apeta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua laihah asim zou un, amaute hanthawnna thu ahiziehin akipah mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Judas leh Sailas zong guolnei ahi ua, thu tamtah genin unaute ahantawh ua, athahatsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tua mun a hun bangtan ahiei ataam nua un, unauten amaute hamuonna thu toh sawltahte kungah anuasawl kiata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hinanleh Silas in khum mun a tam tahdi hoi asa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Paul leh Barnaba Antiok khuo ah atam nalai ua, midang tampi toh Mangpa thu hil in aumden uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tuachi’n ni bangza ahiei nuain Paul in Barnaba kungah, “Mangpa thu igenna khochin a sanggamte bangchin a um tou zel uoi, chia va ve dingin ikuonkhe kia ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tualeh Barnaba in Johan kichi Mak a mautegel toh zawpi a ut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ahivang in aman Pamphilia gam a amautegel nuasie a amaute gel toh na semkhawm nawnlou ahiziehin ama zawpi ding Paul in hoi asa sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tuachi’n nasatahin akinielta ua, akikhenta ua, Barnaba in Johan Mak. Azawpi a Saipras gam ah kuongin apeita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Hinanleh Paul in Sailas atel a, unauten Pasian hepina sunga amaute akep sah nuaun akipandohta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tualeh Siria leh Silisia gam sung pumpi tuon in hattuomte athahat sah uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Derbe khuo leh Listra khuo ah ahing tung hi. Tualeh Ngai vawi, Listra khuo ah Timothi kichi nuazui khat a um a, ama khu gingtu Juda numei khat tapa ahi a, apa pen Greek mi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama pen Listra leh Ikonium khuo a um sanggamten agen phat mama uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Paul in ama khu akhuolzinna a zawpi a ut a, tuachi’n azawpi a, tua gam a Judaten apa Greek mi ahi chi athei zieh un, atep atanpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amaun khopi atotna teng uah, Jerusalem a sawltahte leh upaten zui dinga anamdet uh thupuasahte akung uah apekhe zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n hattuomte khu ginna lam ah ahatsah ua, tualeh ni chinin apung deudeu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuin Paul leh alawmten Phrigia gam leh Galatia gam atotsuoh zou un, Hagau Siengthou in Asia gam a thugen akhamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Misia gam ahing tun nua un, Bithinia gam a pei atum ua, hinanleh Hagau in aphal sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n Misia gam pel in Troas khuo atungsuhta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh zanlai in Paul in mengmu khat anei a, Masidonia gam a mi khat dingin, “Masidonia gam ah hing galkai unlen, koute hing panpi un chi a ngen in amu hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Paul in mengmu amu zouin, Masidonia gam a pei dingin ka kisa pai ua, akung ua khantan hoi gen dingin Pasian in ahing hat ahi chi dihtahin ka thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n Troas khuo apat kuongin ka pei ua, tangtahin Samothrase ah ka pei ua, azing niin Niapolis khuo ah ka tung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuana kipat in Philippi khuo ah ka tung uhi; tua khu Masidonia gam a Rome mite pemkhawmna khopi lienpen ahi. Tua khuo ah ni tam kuomtah ka taam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh khawlni in khopi pulam a luipi gei ah ka pei ua, tua luigei khu thungetna mun ahi a, tualeh ka tou ua, numei hing peikhawmte kungah thu ka genta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh numei khat amin Lidia, puonsandup zua a summet bawl, Thiatira khuo a teng Pasian be mi khat in ka thugen uh aza a, Paul thugen zui ding in Mangpa’n alungtang ahon pieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh ama leh a innkuonpite’n baptisma atan zou un, “Mangpa a ginum a na hing ngaisut u’leh hing pei unlen ka inn ah hing tung un” chi’n ahing chiel hi. Tuachi’n koute ahing houtaangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh thungetna mun a ka pei lai un, dawi lawmnei aisan siem suoh nungah khat in ahing kituohpi hi. Amanu’n aisan a vang gen in apute sum tampipi amusah zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua nungahin Paul leh koute ahing zui a, akikou a, “Tam mite Tungnungpen Pasian suohte ahi ua, eite kunga hundamna lampi kitangkoupite ahi uh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tambangin ni tampi abawl hi. Hinanleh Paul in azada a, akihei a, dawi kungah, amanu sunga kipat hing pawtdoh dingin Jesu “Khrist min in thu ka hing pie hi,” achi hi. Tuachi’n tua hun mama in apawtdoh pai ngal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hinanleh tua suohnu putein asum muna uh abeita chi athei tahun, Paul leh Sailas aman ua, vanzuona mun lah ah akai ua, thuneite mai ah alutpita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh thukhenpa mai ah amaute ahing pui ua, “Tam mite Judami ahi ua, ka khopi uh asubuoi mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh ei Rome miten izui leh ichiin sienglou tawndan khat ahing hil uhi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuachi’n mipi tampite zong Paul leh Sailas dou in apangkhawm uhi, tualeh thukhenten apuonte uh ahawhkhiet pieh ua, chiengpum a jep dingin thu apie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tam veipi ajep nua un suongkul ah akhum ua, bittah a veng dingin avengmipa kungah thu apie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tambanga thupieh khautah muin, tangvengpa’n suongkul dantan sungnung ah amauh akhum a, akeng uah siakol abunsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hinanleh zankim lai in Paul leh Sailas in thu angen ua, Pasian kungah phatna la asa ua, suongkul tangten angai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Thakhat in zil nasatahin ahing kilinga tuachi’n suongkul suongphumte nangawn akiling gawp a, tualeh suongkul kotkhate zousie ahing kihong pai a, michin kolbu zousie ahing kitol siengta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuachi’n suongkul vengpa imu lai ahing khanglou a, suongkul kotkhate kihongsa a um amu tahin, suongkul taangte taimang sieng uh hitava achi a, anamsau adoh a ama leh ama akitha tum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hinanleh Paul aw ngaitah a kikou in, “Bangma kilaw sin, ka bawn un tanah ka umkim uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuachi’n mitangte vengpain, meivah angen a, atai lut a, chitun kawm in Paul leh Sailas mai ah akhupboh ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tualeh amaute ahing puidoh a, “Pute hundam a ka umna dingin bang ahiei ka bawl ding” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaun “Mangpa Jesu Khrist gingtain, tuachi’n hundamin na um ding hi, nang leh na innkuonpite toh achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuachi’n amauten ama kungah leh a inn a um zousiete kungah Mangpa thu agenta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuami zanlai mama in aman amaute apui a ajepna huoltaite uh asawpsieng pieh a, tualeh ama leh aiinkuonpite zousie in baptisma atang pai ngal uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Aman amaute a inn sungah apuilut a, amasang uoh ann neh ding alui a, ama leh a innkuonpiten Pasian thu a gintat zieh un akipah mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Zingmawng khuo ahing vahtahin, thukhenten, Suongkul vengpa kunga, tua mite ha in, chi dingin “Miman galkapte asawl uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tuachi’n suongkul vengpa’n Paul kungah, “Thukhenmiten nang leh Sailas ha na ding thu ahing pie ua, tuaziehin tuin pawt unlen ha muongtahin peita un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Hinanleh Paul in akung uah, “Rome mi ka hi ngal ua, mawpaina umlou a, vantang mitmu in ahing jep ua suongkul ah ahing khum ua, tuin hing dap hakhiet sawm uh hiven izaw? hi thei ngailou ding hi, amaute mama hing pei u’henlen, hing puidoh uheh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tua miman galkap lamkaiten, tua thute thukhenmite kungah ahil ua, Romemite ahi uh chi azah tahun azauta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaute ahing pei ua, azawl ua, apuidoh ua, khopi nuasie dingin angen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaute suongkul apat ahing pawtdoh ua, Lidia inn ah ahaw ua, unaute amu tah un, ahantawh ua, apeita uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuin Amphipolis khuo leh Apollonia khuo nawt in apei suoh ua, Thessalonika khuo atungta ua, tuanah Judate kikhopna inn khat a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n Paul in abawl ngaina bangin akung uah alut a, khawlni thumvei, Laisiengthou thu amaute akikuppi zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khrist in athuohgim ding mawng ahidante, tualeh mishi lah akipat thoukia ngei ding ahidan leh tam na kung ua “Ka gen Jesu khu Khrist ahi chia hilchien in atahlang hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n alah ua mi pawlkhat in agingta ua, tualeh Pasian a mi kipumpieh Greek mite tampi leh numei lamkai tawm liei louten Paul leh Sailas azuita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hinanleh agingtalou Judaten athangsiet ua, migilou thasie koite ahiei, vanzuona munte a kipat ahankhawm ua, khopisung zousie asubuoi ua, Jason inn abulu ua, Paul leh Sailas khu mipite kungah puidoh atum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amaute amulou tah un, Jason leh unau pawlkhatte khopi sung vaihawmte masangah akailut ua, akikou ua, “Leitung pumpi kikhulesah mihingte tami mun nasan ahing tungta ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jason in ana zintun a, tam miten Kaisar thupiehte kalin, Jesu kichi leeng dangkhat a um hi, achi uhi,” achi ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mipite leh khopi sung vaihawm miten tam thu azah tahun a pumbuoita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n amauten Jason leh midangte akipat kihenna silte ala ua, amaute ahadohta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n unauten azan zanin Paul leh Sailas Beria khuo ah asawlkhe pai ua; khuna ava tuntah un, Judate kikhopna inn ah alut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Beria mite khu Thessalonika khuo a mite sangin alungsim uh akihong zaw ua, lungsim kilawptah in thu apom ua, athugente uh adih leh dihlou theina dingin, nichin in Laisiengthou thu sui in a enchien zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaziehin Judate tampi in agingta ua, Greekte lah a numei leh pasal zatat huoi tawm thamlouten zong agingta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hinanleh Thessalonika khuoa Judaten, Paul in Beria khuo ah Pasian thu agen hi chi, athei bep un, khunah zong ahing pei ua mipite hanthawn in achiilsie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n unauten kintahin Paul khu tuipi lam a pei dingin asawlkhe pai ua, hinanleh Sailas leh Timothi pen Beria ah a um tadi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n Paul vahaten ama Athen khuo ava tunpi uhi; tualeh Sailas leh Timothi khu akintheipen a akunga hing pei dinga athuhah thu puoin apeita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Paul in Athen khuo a, Sailas leh Timothi ana ngah sungin, tua khopi milim pasiente a dim in amu a, alungthah mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaziehin kikhopna inn ah, Judate leh Pasian bie Jentelte thu akinielpi zel hi, tualeh vanzuona muna na um poumate zong nichin in akinielpi zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n Epikuriamite leh Stoik mite lah a, mipil koite ahieiin zong, ama ahing niel uhi. Tualeh Pawlkhat in tam mi kamtampa’n “Bang ahiei agen tup?” achi uhi. Pawl dangkhat ten lah “Gamdang pasiente thugen hileh kilawm veh aw” achi uhi, ama’n Jesu thu leh athawkiana thu agen zieh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh ahing pui ua, Areopagus mun ah atutta ua, akungah, “Tam thuhilna tha na gen khu na hing theisah thei diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sillamdang bang ahiei khat ka bil uah na hing zasahta a, bangchina ahiei a umdan ka thei nuom uhi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Aziehpen Athen mite leh tua mun a um gamdang mite zousiein, sil tha tha genna leh ngaikhiehna loungal bangma dangin ahunte uh azang sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuachi’n Areopagus kikhopna lai ah Paul adinga, agenta hi Athen khuo a mite aw, Banglam pou ah sakhuo biehna ngaisah mi na hi uh chi ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aziehpen ka vah kawma na bieh silte uh ka et leh maitam khat atunga “THEILOU PASIAN A DING”, chi a kigiel nangawn ka mu hi. Tuaziehin theiloupi a na bieh pen uh, Ama ahi noute kunga ka kitangkoupi khu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Leitung pumpi leh asunga sil um zousie siempa Pasian khu, lei leh van Mangpa ahiziehin, mihingte khuta bawl innte ah a um ngai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ama pen tahsapna nei bangin, mihingte khuta nasep pieh in a um ngai sih hi, Aman mi zousie kungah hinna, nahna leh sil zousie ape zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tualeh Aman mi khat sisan a kipat in mi namchin leitung pumpi luosuoh dingin abawl a, amaute dingin hunbite abawl pieh a, tenna ding gamgite ahunpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuachia amaun kinem tah a Mangpa asui ua; amai amai ua Ama amu teitei na ding un; Aman lah eite ahing gamlat chiet sih ngal a
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Aziehpen, Ama ah eite ihing ua, i pia ua, hinna inei uhi; Noute lah mama a na laphuoh siemte un: Eite zong Ama hahlesuonte i hi uhi, chi a agen bangun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuaziehin Pasian hahlesuonte ihi zieh un, Pasian pen mihingte khutsiem silbawl Sana, dangka, ahisihleh suong, banga ingaisut ding uh ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Adihtahin Pasian in bangma itheilou lai un, ahing kitheimaw bawl a, hinanleh tuin vang, mun chin a um mi zousie kisia dingin thu apeta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Aman ni achiem ziehin, tua ni chiengin ami guotpa tungtawnin leitung pumpi dihtattah in vai ahawm pieh dinga, Pasian in ami guotpa mishi lah a kipat kaithouin mi zousie kungah atheisahta hi, achi hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Amauten mishi thawkiana thu azah tah un, Pawlkhat in anuisat ua, pawlkhat in lah “Tam thu nanga kipat ka ngai nuom nalai uhi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuachi’n Paul amaute lah akipat apeita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ahivang in mi bangza ahiei in Paul azui ua, agingta ta uhi. Amaute lah ah Areopagus mi Dionisius leh numei khat amin Damaris leh akung ua midangte toh ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tam silte nuain Paul Athen khuo akipat Korinth zuon in apeita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh amin Akuila kichi Juda mi khat amu a, tua mipa khu Pontius gam a pieng ahi a, Klaudia in Judate zousie Rome khuo akipat pawtdoh dinga thupieh apieh zieh a, azi Prisilla toh, tumasang zepa Itali akipat hing tung pan bep ahi ua, Paul amaute kungah ahing haw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n anasep uh puonbuh bawl ahi a, anasep uh akibang ahi ziehin akung uah atunga, amautoh na asemkhawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh khawlni chinin kikhopna inn ah, Judate leh Greek mite gintat sah tum in thu akikupi zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Silas leh Timothi Masidonia gam akipat ahing tun tah un, Paul in Hagau theisahnain thu ngentang genin aumta a, Judate kungah Jesu khu Khrist ahi chi theipina thu genin ahil chien zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hinanleh Judaten ama akal ua, agensiet tahun, aman apuonsilte athinga, akung uoh, “Na sisan maw uh nouma lutungah tuta heh! Keipen ka sieng ahi, tu kalsie Jentelte kungah ka peita ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n khuna pat in apei a, mi khat amin Titus Justus kichipa inn ah alut a, tua mipa’n Pasian abe zel a, a inn zong kikhopna inn toh kizom ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n Krispus kikhopna inn vaihawmpa’n a innkuonpite zousie toh Mangpa agingta ua, Korinth khuo a mi tampiin zong Paul thugen zain, agingta ua, baptisma atang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n zanlai in mengmuna in Paul ahoupi a, “Zau sinlen, sip louin thu gen zelin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kei na kungah ka um ngitnget hi, koiman hing suliem dingin na tung ah khut aha sih ding hi, aziehpen tam khuo ah mi tampi ka nei hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n Paul khum khuo ah kum khat leh ha guh ataam a, alah uah Pasian thu ahil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Gallio Akaia gam uhpa ahilai in Judaten kithutuoh tahin Paul aman ua, thukhenna mai ah ahing tut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Tam mipa’n dan toh kituoh loupi a Pasian be dingin mi azawl hi,” chiin aheh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Paul in thu gen ding a akisah laitahin, Gallio in Judate kungah, “Aw nou Judate, sil hoilou bawl thu ahiei, gitlou gamtatna thu ahiei beeh hileh ka hing ngaisah tham ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hinanleh thute leh minte tualeh nouma dan thute ahi giap leh, nouman kingaituo zaw un, tambang thute ah thukhenpain ka pang ut sih hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n thukhenna toupha mai a kipat in amaute adeldohta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n Greek mi zousiein kikhopna inn vaihawmpa Sosthenes aman ua, thukhenna toupha mai ah avuo uhi. Hinanleh Gallio in tam silte bangma in angai pieh sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n Paul khu Korinth khuo ah hun sawttah ataam nalai a, tua zouin unaute toh akivaihah a, Siria gam lam zuonin kuongin apeita hi, tualeh Prisilla leh Akuila toh zong azawhkhawm uhi. Kichiemna khat anei ziehin Kenkeria khuo ah Paul in asam aheu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ephesa khuo atunga, tuanah Prisilla leh Akuila anuasie a, hinanleh ama pen kikhopna inn ah alut a Judate toh thu asuut khawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amauten akung ua sawtdeu taam tadi dingin ahou ua, ama a ut sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hinanleh amaute avaihah a, ahing tung ding Jerusalem a annkuongluina ah tel teitei ka tum hi; “Pasian in pha asah leh na kung uah ka hing peikia ding hi” achi hi. Tualeh Ephesa khuo akipat kuongin apeita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuachi’n Kaisaria ahing tunga, apeitou a hattuomte ava nousiet a, Antiok khuo ah apeisuhta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Antiok a hun bangtan ahiei ataam nuain akipankhie a, Galatia gam leh Phrigia gam zousie atuon suoh a, nuazuite zousie a sudet a, athakhausah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Juda mi khat amin Appolo, Alekzandria khuo a pieng, thugen siem leh Laisiengthou thu thei mama, Ephesa khuo ah ahaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tam mipa pen Mangpa lampi thu zilsa ahia; Johan baptisma thu maimai theinanleh lungsim a phatuom ngaitah in, Mangpa thu gen in ahilchien zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuachi’n kikhopna innte ah hangsan tahin thu agen panta a; Prisilla leh Akuilain athugen azah un, a inn uah azawpi ua, Pasian lampi thu kichien zaw sem in ahilchien uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tualeh ama’n Akaia gam a pei atup tahin, unauten ahantawh ua, ama ana kipahpina dingun khum gam a nuazuite kungah lai ahah uhi, tualeh ama atun tah in hepina zieh in gingtute nasatahin apanpita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Aziehpen ama’n vantang theiin Judate anieldonga Laisiengthou thu pansan in Jesu khu Khrist ahi, chi athei sah hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh Korinth khuo a Apollo aum sungin Paul in mallam gamkai tuonsuoh zouin Ephesa khuo ah ahing tunga, khunah nuazui koite ahiei amu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aman akung uah, “Na gintat chiillai un Hagau Siengthou na tang uoi?” achi hi. Amaun akungah, “Hagau Siengthou um chi zong ka zakha ngai mawngmawng sih uhi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman akung uah, “Bang baptisma ahiei na tan uh?” achi hi. Amauten “Johan baptisma,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n Paul in, “Johan in anua a hing pei dingpa gingta ding a mite hil in kisiana baptisma in a baptis zel hi. Tua ahing pei dingpa khu Khrist Jesu ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amauten tam thu azah tah un, Mangpa Jesu min in baptisma atangta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh Paul in atung ua akhut angah tahin, Hagau Siengthou atung uah ahing tungta a, ham theilouin aham ua, thu agenta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amaute abawn un mi sawm leh ni ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Paul khu kikhopna inn ah alut a, ha thum sung hangsantah in thu agen a, Pasian leenggam thu ah kinielpi in, mi a zawl lut zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hinanleh pawlkhatte kilungkhausah in agingta ut sih ua, mipite mai a tua Lampi agensiet tahun, Paul in amauh apeisan a, nuazuite azawpi a, Tiranus sekul ah nisim in thu akikuppi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tambangin kum ni sung a um a, tuachi’n Asia gam pumpi a um Judate leh Greekte zousiein, Mangpa Jesu thu azata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pasian in Paul khut zangin sillamdang tuom mawngmawngte abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n Paul satung toh kisukha mainulna diel neu, ahisihleh puonah tungsilte, damloute kungah ahing tawi ua, anatnate uh adam zel a, tualeh asung ua dawi gilou umte zong apawtkhie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n dawi thusiem vielvah Judate pawl khat in “Paul in athu atangkoupi zel Jesu min in ka hing vau hi,” chiin dawi vei mite tungah, Mangpa Jesu min alou zel uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Juda siempu lien khat, Skeva in tuabanga bawl tapa sagi anei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hinanleh dawi in adawnga, “Jesu ka thei a, Paul zong ka thei hi, hinanleh noute koite na hi uoi?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n dawi matpa’n amaute abaw a, azou a, abawnun anuoinet a, tuachi’n tua inn akipat in saguoh leh liem in ataidoh ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tam thu Ephesa khuo a teng Judate leh Greekte zousiein athei tahun azau mama ua, Mangpa Jesu min nasatah a tawisangin a umta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh agingtate tampi zong ahing pei ua, asilbawlte uh thupha tawi in akipuong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mitphieldawi tawi mi tampi in alaibute uh ahing tawi khawm ua, mi zousie mitmu in ahalta uhi, tualeh aman atuot ua, dangka tul sawmnga man apha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n thupitah maiin Mangpa thu adalzahta a, a guolzou zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua silte nuain Paul in alungsim in Masidonia gam leh Akaia gam atotsuoh zou chienga Jerusalem khuo a pei atum a, “Khuna ka pei zou chiengin Rome khuo zong kava pha teitei ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuachi’n ama nasepna panpi mi ni Timothi leh Erastus Masidonia gam ah asawl a, hinanleh ama pen Asia gam ah hun bangtan ahiei ataam nalai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua hun lai vel in tua Lampi thu ziehin buoina lientah a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Aziehpen mi khat amin Demetrius dangka-sia khengmi khat a um a, Dangka sia in Diana biehna inn neu limte bawlin khutsiemte kungah sum muna hoitah asuohsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ama’n tuabanga khutsiem azahte leh tuabanga nasem dangte ahankhawm a, akung uah, “Lawmte aw, tam nasepna akipat in sum muna hoitah inei uh chi na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tam Ephesa khuo guoh ah hilou in, Asia gam pumpi ah, tam Paul in khut a bawlte pen pasiente ahi sih uh chiin mi tampi athuzaw a akiheisah siengta chi, na mu un na za uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuachi’n eite nasep sum muna ahing suhsiet ding zauhuoina guoh hilouin, pasiennu thupitah Diana biehinn zong ahing kingai neu ding a, tualeh Asia gam pumpi leh leitung pumpi miten abieh uh Diana thupina suhsiet in ahing um kha ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tam thu azah tahun, alungthah mama ua, “Ephesa mite Diana athupi hi,” chiin akikou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuachi’n khosung pumpi buoinain apumdimta a, Masidonia mi Paul in akhuolzinna a azawpite gel, Gaius leh Aristarkus apum mat ua, kituohtahin etnop bawlna inn ah atailutpita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tualeh Paul in mipite lah a lut atup leh, nuazuiten aphal sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tualeh Asia gam a houtu lienpente lah a Paul lawmte pawlkhat in akungah mi asawl ua, etnop bawlna inn a lut teitei lou dingin ahou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tua mun a mipi kikhawmte apumbuoi ua, pawlkhat sil khat akikoupi ua, adangten sil tuom dang khat akikoupi ua, alah ua atamzawin akikhopna zieh uh athei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Mipite lah akipat Alekzandar akaidoh ua, Judaten ama mipite mailam ah asawn uhi. Tualeh Alekzandar in akhut azap a mipite kungah asiemna thu gen atum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hinanleh ama Juda mi ahi chi athei tahun, naikal ni sung dingvel, aw kituohtah in “Ephesamite Diana athupi hi” chiin akikou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tualeh khopi laigielpa’n mipite asipsah a, Ephesa khuo a mite aw, “Ephesamite khu pasiennu thupitah Diana pen Zeus akipat hing kesuh milim biehinn venga kemte ahi uh chi theilou koi a um ei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tuaziehin tam thu niel guollou ahi nuain, na sip khinkhian ding uh ahi, kinawhehu a bangma na bawllou ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Aziehpen tam na hing mi zawpite uh pen, biehinn bulu mi lah ahi sih ua, i pasiennu uh gensie lah ahi sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tuaziehin Demetrius leh anaseppi khutsiem miten mi koi ahiei tunga thubuoi anei u’leh, thukhenna inn honsa in aum hi, tualeh gam uhpipate zong a um uhi; kiheh u’heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Hinanleh sildanga buoina nei na hi u’leh, dan banga kikhopna ah ngaituo ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tunia buoina ziehin, itung ua thu ahing um khah ding azauhuoi hi, ikikhopna san pen tami zieh ahi chi ding a um sih hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tualeh aman tambanga agen zouin mipi kikhawmte akikhensahta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Buoina aven nuain, Paul in nuazuite akung ah ahan a, amauh ahantawh zou in Mangpha ahah a, Masidonia gam zuonin apeita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua gam sungah azin a, amau hanthawnna thu tampi agen zouin Greek gam atungta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuanah ha thum ataam a, tualeh Judaten ama abuhdap zieh un, Siria gam langa kuonga pei dinga kisa lai, Masidonia gam langa pei dingin akisa kiata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh Berea khomi Pirhus tapa Sopatar, Thessalonika khuo a mite Aristarkus leh Sekundus, Derbe khomi Gaius leh Timothi, tualeh Asia gam mite Tikikus leh Trophimus in Asia gam dongin azui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tam mite ka masang uah ana pei ua, Troas khuo ah ahing na ngah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hinanleh koute pen Tanghou tolsawlou pawi bawl nua in, Phillipi akipat in tembaw in ka pei ua, ni nga zou in amaute umna Troas khuo ka tung ua, tuanah ni sagi ka taam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nipikaal ni masapen ni in nuazuite tanghou balkeh dinga ahing peikhawm lai un, Paul in azing ni a pei atup ziehin amauh kungah thu agen a, zankim dongin akihoulimpi a thu ahil zom tou peh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Inndan tungnung a akikhopna uah, thaumei tampi akitaang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh amin Eutikus kichi tangval khat kotta ah atou a, tuitahin ana imu hi, Paul in thu agen sawt seng ziehin, imu lai innsawng thumna akipat in akesuh a, ashisa in aphong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Paul avakumsuh a, atungah abawh a, apom a, “Patau sih un, ahing nalai hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Paul inndan tunga akaltou kia bepin, tanghou abalkeh a, ane a, sawtpi zingmawng khovah dongin ahoulim a, apeita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amauten tangvalpa hingin ahing zawpi ua, akidawmpah sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n koute tembaw lam ah kana pei ua, tualeh Assos lam zuon in kana pei masa ua, tua mun ah Paul zong tuonsah ka sawm ua, aman keng lam a pei atup zieh in kengin hing pei zawvang achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh Assos khuo a ahing kimupi tahin, ka tuongsahta ua, Mitilene khuo ka tungta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuana kipat in tembawin ka pei kia ua, azing niin Kios tuikuol gam gallam ka tung ua, tualeh azing ni in Samos ka tung ua, Trogilium ah ka tam ua, azing niin Mileta khuo ka tung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Paul in Asia gama taam sawt a utlou ziehin Ephesa khuo tembaw a pei pel atupsa mawng ahia; ahithei liei leh Jerusalem khuo a pentikos pawi lap a tun a ut a, kin pei ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mileta khuo akipat, Ephesa khuo ah mi asawl a, hattuom upate ava hansah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amaute a kunga ahing tun tahun,” Paul in amaute kungah, Asia gam a ka hing tun chiil ni masa ni akipata na lah ua ka um sungsie a ka umdan na thei uhi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lungsim a kingaingiemna leh Judaten ahing zebawl ua ahing bawlsietzieh ua hitui tampi toh ka tung a hing tungte thuoh kawmin Mangpa nna ka sem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Noute phattuomna ding bangma im ka nei sih a, ka hing theisah sieng hi, tangpi theiin thu ka gen a, inn chin ah noute thu kang hil ngitnget hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Judate leh Greekte kungah zong, Pasian lam a kihei kisiana thu leh i Mangpa Jesu Khrist lam a ginna thu ka theisah zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuin Ngai un, Hagau a kolbun in Jerusalem a hawtou dinga kisa ka hia, khunah ka tunga sil hing tungdingte ka thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Henna leh gimthuohna in ahing na dawn ding chi a, Hagau Siengthou in khochin a, ahing theisahte maimaite ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hinanleh ka kitaidemna kipahtah a ka taitung theina ding leh Mangpa Jesu a kipat a ka mu, Pasian hepina khantanhoi theisah ding nasepna ka sep zou theina dingin, tam silte khat beehin ahing suling sih a, ka hinna zong it taahin ka ngai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tualeh tuin Ngai un, noute zousie lah a, Pasian leenggam thu gen a ka vah kawinate’n ka mel na mu nawn sih ding uh, chi ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuaziehin mi zousie sisan ah ka sieng ahi chi tuni’n ka hing theisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Aziehpen Pasian thuguot zousie noute kunga phuondoh lou a im ka nei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuaziehin noute pilvang unlen, belamhonte zousie vengun, Pasian Hattuom Ama sisan a aleisate vah dingin, Hagau Siengthouin amaute lah a belampu hi dingin noute ahing guot ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Aziehpen ka pei nua chiengin, ngia giloute na lah uah ahing lut dinga, belamhon akhawi sih ding uh, chi ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Nouma lah mama ah zong nuazuite amauh lam a kaimang dingin, thu alelam a gen ahing um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuaziehin kivengun, kum thum vingveng, asun azan a hitui luong kawma, michin phawhhil ka tawp lou dan thei ngitnget un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuin unaute, noute hing lamtou a, hing khangsah thei a, mi suhsiengthousate lah a goutan pe thei Pasian leh akhotuona thu ah noute ka hing kemsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Koima sana, dangka leh sil leh ten, ka eng ngai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tam khutte’n keima leh ka kunga umte tahsap awng hu in ka sem zel chi noute mamain na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Bangkim ka bawl zousie nouten zong tambanga semgim leh Mangpa Jesu thu thei ngitnget kawmin mi hatloute na panpi ding dan uh hing ensah ka hi. Mangpa Jesu mama in lah sangin pieh hi guolzawlna sangzaw a hi,” achi khu thei ngitnget un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tam thute agen zouin, khupdin in amaute zousie toh athum khawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tualeh a unpi un akap ua, Paul angawng kawi ua, atawp uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Amel amu nawnlou ding uh, thu agenin amauh adasah pen hi. Tualeh amaun tembaw umna mun tan dong ava ha ta uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Amautoh ka kikhen nua un, tembaw ah ka tuong ua, tangtahin ka pei ua, Kos ka tung ua, azingniin Rhodes ka tung ua, tuana pat in Patara khuo ka tung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuanah Phoenicia gam a pei ding Tembaw khat ka mu ua, ka tuong ua, ka peita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Saipras tuikuol gam ka galmu tahun, veilam ah ka pel ua, Siria gam zuon in ka pei ua, Tai-ar khuo ka tung uhi, tembaw vante suokhe ding ahizieh un, tua khopi ah ka kum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nuazuite ka suidoh ua, tuanah ni sagi ka taam uhi; amaun hagau theisahnain, Paul kungah Jerusalem ah hawtou sin achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua mun a ni sagi ka taam zou un, ka kipandoh ua, ka peina ding uh ka zuonta ua, a unpi un azi leh atate utoh khopi pulam tan ahing ha ua, tuachi’n tuipi gei ah khupdin in thu ka ngen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mangpha ka kihah zou un, koute tembaw ah ka tuong ua, amaute inn langah anua peikiata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tai-ar khuo akipat tembaw in ka pei zel ua, Tolemai khuo ka tung ua, unaute ka nousiet ua, akung uah ni khat ka taam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Azingni in ka kipandoh ua, Kaisaria ka tung ua, sagite lah a khat, sawltah Philip inn ah ka lut ua, tuanah ama toh ka um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Philip in tanu, nungah Siengthou li anei a, amauten guolnei bangin thu agen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua khuo a ni tampi ka tam sungun, Judia gam a kipat amin Agabus kichi guolnei khat ahing haw suh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama ka kung uah ahing haw a, Paul kawnggah ala a, akhutte leh akengte akikaan a, “Tam kawnggah neipa, Jerusalem khuo a Judaten tambangin akaan ding ua, Jentelte khut ah ape ding uhi, Hagau Siengthou in achi hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tam thu ka zah tahun, koute leh tua mun a umten, Paul Jerusalem khuo a hawlou dingin ka hou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n Paul in nouten kap a na hing hasietsah uh “Bang na china uh ahiei? Mangpa Jesu min a Jerusalem a kaan a um bep hilouin shi ding nangawn ngap ka hi,” chi’n adawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachia hou zou guol ahilou tahin ka tawp ua, “Mangpa thu thu hita heh,” ka chita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua nite nuain ka kisa ua, Jerusalem ah ka pei touta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kaisaria apat nuazui pawlkhat in zong ahing zui ua, amaun Mnason inn ah ahing zawpi ua, tuanah ka tung uhi. Ama Saipras gam a nuazui masate lah a khat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jerusalem ka tuntah un unauten kipahtah in ang na dawn uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Azingniin Paul leh kouten Jakob ka vave ua, tuanah hattuom upate zousie zong a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Paul in amaute a nousiet zouin, ama nasepna tungtawn a Jentelte lah a Pasian silbawlte abanban in agen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amauten tam thu azah tahun, Pasian apahtawi uhi. Tualeh amauten Paul kungah, “Sanggampa aw, Judate lah a mi tul tampiin agintat taah dan uh na thei hi. Tualeh amaute zousie in dan thu ah phatuom angai mama uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hinanleh nang, Jentelte lah a Juda umte zousie kung ah, atate uh teptan lou ding leh tawndante zui lou ding, chiin Mosi dan paidohna ding thu na hil zel hi chi mi kam a kipat in na thu ana thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Bangchi hita ding ahiei le? Na hing tung chi lah aza ngei ding ua, mipi ahing peikhawm ngeingei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuaziehin na kunga ka gen bangun bawlin, kichiemna nei pasal li ka nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Amaute pui inlen, amau’toh kisiensuo inlen, asam heukieuna ding uh sum tuohpieh in, tuachi’n mi zousiein mi kam a na thu azah teng uh, bangmalou ahi chi athei ding ua, nang pen kituptah a dan zuiin na um zaw hi, chi athei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Jentel gingtute tungtang thu ah pen, milim biehna sa anehlou ding uh, sisan anehlou ding uh, hehlup sa anehlou ding uh, kingaina thanghuoi lah apat akihepkhiet ding uh, chiloungal sildang atang sih ding uh, chiin ka gen ua, ka gielta uhi, achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuachi’n azingni in Paul in tua kichiemna nei mite azawpi a, amaute toh ava kisiensuo a, Pasian biehinn ah alut a, kisiensuona ni bei hun ding leh, amaute chiet a dinga asillat hun ding uh, siempu kungah ava theisah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kisiensuona ni sagi abei ding kuon tahin, Asia gam a Judaten Pasian bieh inna Paul amutahun, mipi zousie achiilsie ua, Paul apum mat ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />akikou ua, “Israel mite aw hing panpi un! Tam mipa ahi, munchin a mi zousie kunga Judamite, dan leh tam mun gensie, tuathamlouin aman Greekte tam biehinn huongsungah alutpi a, tam bieh inn siengthou asubua zouta hi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Aziehpen tumasang laiin khopi sungah Ephesa khomi Trophima Paul toh umkhawm amu ua, Paul in ama bieh inn sunga hing puilut tain agingta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuachi’n khojangin abuoipita ua, mipite hing taikhawmin Paul aman ua, biehinnpi akipat akaidoh ua, kotpite akha pai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Paul that dinga akisah laitah un, Jerusalem khuoa mi zousie abuoijahta uh chi thu galkap lamkai lienpen kungah atung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ama’n galkapte leh galkap zahoutu azawpi pai a, akung uah ataisuh a, tuachi’n amauten galkap lienpen leh galkapte amu tahun, Paul avuoh uh atawpta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuachi’n galkap lienpen ahing pei a Paul aman a, sia khainieng ni a hen ding thu apie a, tualeh aman Paul khu koi ahia, bang ahiei abawl chiin adong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Mipite lah a pawlkhat thu khat genin akikou ua, midangte lah thudang genin akikou uhi. Tualeh buoi zieh in thutah atheichien theisih a, galkapte giehbuh a, ama peipi dingin galkapte thu apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tualeh Paul kalbi atun tahin, mipite alungthah mama zieh un, galkapten ama apuohthaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Aziehpen mipiten azui ua, “Ama that un,” chiin akikou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Galkapten giehbuh sunga Paul lutpi ding a akisah lai un, aman galkapte lamkai lienpen kungah na kungah “Thu khat ka gen thei diei?” achi a, tualeh aman “Greek ham na thei ama?” chiin adong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tumasang lai a helna bawl a, mi that pawl, mi tulli val gamdai a puidohpa, Izipt mi hilou na hiei mah?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Hinanleh Paul in, “Kei Judami, Sillisia gam a Tursas khuo ami ka hi, khopi neu a piengka hisih hi, hing hepi inlen mipite kungah thu hing gen sahin,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tuachia phalna apieh tahin, Paul kalbi tungah adinga, mipi lam ngain akhut azap a, amaute asip dide tah un, akung uah Hebru ham in thu agen hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Sanggamte leh pate aw, tuin na kung uah ka dihna thu ka gen ding hi,” na ngai un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh akung ua Hebru ham a thu agen azah tahun, asipta semsem uhi. Tuachi’n aman.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Kei Judami ka hi a, Sillisia gam a Tarsas khuo a pieng ka hi, hinanleh tam khopi a Gamiliel kengbul a khanglien ka hia, ipu ipate uh dan khautah dungzui a zildoh a, tuni a noute banga Pasian lam a phatuomngai ka na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tam Lam zui mite shina khopin kana bawlsie a, numei leh pasalte ka kaan a, suongkul ah ka khum zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Siempu lien leh upa vaihawmte zousie in zong tua thu ahing theipi uhi; amaute a kipat in Damaska a um unaute pieh dingin lai ka la a, tam mite Jerusalem a gawt dingin, kaansa a hing kai dingin Damaska lam zuon in ka peita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Damaska ka tun ding kuonin, sunkim lai tahin, thakhat in van akipat in vah thupitah ka kim ah ahing taang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n kei tuol ah ka pua a, tualeh aw khat in Saul, Saul, nang bangdinga kei hing bawlsie na hiei? chiin ka za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n ken Mangpa koi na hiei? chiin ka dawng hi. Tualeh Aman ka kungah, Kei na suhgenthei Nazareth Jesu ka hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka kunga kei toh umkhawmten vah amu ua, azau uhi, hinanleh, Kei hing houpipa aw pen aza sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ken, Mangpa bang ka bawl diei? ka chi hi. Tualeh Mangpa’n ka kungah, Thou inlen Damaska khosung ah lut in, tuanah sil zousie na bawl dingte, ahing kihil ding hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua vah athupi seng ziehin khuo ka mu thei nawn sih a ka lawmten akhut un ahing kai ua, Damaska khuo ah ka lutta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Tuachi’n Anania kichi mi khat, dan dungzui a mi kipezoutah leh tua khuo a um Judate zousie in agen phat uh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka kungah ahing pei a, ka kunga dingin, Sanggampa, Saul, khuo muta in ahing chi hi. Tualeh tua hun laitah mama in, ama ka mu thei pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n ama’n, ipu ipate Pasian in, Ama deilam thei ding leh Adihtatpa mu a, akam a pawt aw za dinga ahing teldoh ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aziehpen na mu leh na zah thu ah mi zousie kunga Ama theipi mi na hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuin bang ngah nalai na hiei? Thou inlen baptisma tangin, Mangpa min in thungen inlen, na khelnate silsiengin, ahing chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Tualeh hichi ahing hi a, Jerusalem a ka kinuale kia zou a, biehinn a ka thunget laiin, mengmuna ka mu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kinaw inlen, kintahin, Jerusalem a kipat in pawt in, aziehpen kei nang theipina thu amauten pom lou ding ahi uh, hing chi in Ama ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n ken, Mangpa kikhopna innte a banluta, Nang hing gingtate suongkul a khuma ka vuoh zel dan amaun athei mama ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh Na thu theipipa Stephen sisan asuo lai un thukimpi in amaute kungah ka dinga, ama thatte puonsilte kana keem hi, ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n Aman ka kungah, Pei in! tana kipata gamla tah a, Jentelte kunga hing sawl ding ka hi, ahing chita hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amauten Paul in tamtan dong agen angaikhie ua, tuachi’n aw ngaitahin akikou ua, “Tambang mihing leitunga pat sumangun, hingtaah ahi sih hi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuachi’n akikou pum un, apuonte uh abotkeh ua, van lam ah leivui athe ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Galkap lamkai lienpen in, galkapte giehbuh sunga Paul puilut ding thu apie hi, tambang lawmlawm a atungthu a akikouna zieh uh theichienna dingin zep a dohchien ding, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hinanleh ama savun khau a akaan laiun, Paul in akunga ding galkap zahoutupa kungah “Rome khopi mi khat poupou siemlou tansahna umlou a, vuohna ding thuneina na nei uoi mah?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Galkap zahoutupa’n tua thu azah tahin galkap lamkai lienpen kungah ava pei a, “Na silbawl dingah pilvangin tam mipa Romemi ahi,” chiin ava hil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuachi’n galkap lienpenpa ahing pei a, akungah, “Rome mi na hi amah?” hing hil in achi hi. Paul in hi ma “Inge,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tualeh galkap lamkai lienpen pa’n, “Tam khomi hina ken sum tampi a ka lei ahi,” achi hi, Paul in “Kei pen Rome mi hisa a pieng ka hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuachi’n dongchien dinga kisate akikangkoi pai uhi, tualeh galkap lamkai lienpenpa’n zong Rome mi khat kaan kha ahi chi akithei tahin a zauta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Azingniin galkap lamkai lienpenpa’n Paul kolbute asutkhie a, bangzieh a Judaten aheh uh ahiei, chi theinuom in, siempu liente leh vaihawm mite zousie kikhawm dingin thu apie a, Paul ahing zawpi ua, amaute mai ah ading sahta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Paul in vaihawm pawlte a en pimpem a, sanggamte aw, tuni tan in Pasian masanga ka sie leh pha theina siengtah toh ka hinkhuo zangtou zel ka hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n siempu lien Anania in Paul kunga dingte kungah akam behpieh dingin thu apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuabep in Paul in akungah, nang baang kinungoupa Pasian in nangma hing beeng ding ahi aw! Dan toh kituoh a ka tunga thukhen dinga tou hinapi chin a, dan palsan a kei beeng dingin thu na pie maw? achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh Paul kunga dingte’n, nang Pasian siempu lien, na hichi phawh ngam vielmaw? achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n Paul in sanggamte aw, ama siempu lien ahi chi ka thei sih a ahi; Na mite uh tunga vaihawm mite tungah thu hoilou gen sin, chi gel ahima ve, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hinanleh Paul in amaute lah a pawl khat Saddukaite ahi ua, adangte Pharisaite ahi uh chi athei tahin, vaihawm na ah akikou a, Sanggamte aw, Kei Pharisai ka hi a, Pharisai tapa ka hi, kinepna leh mishi thawkiana thu toh kisaia vaihawmna masanga dinsah ka hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tam thu agen tahin, Pharisaite leh Saddukaite kaal ah kiselna a pieng a, vaihawm pawlte akilangkhenta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aziehpen Saddukaiten, thawkiana mawngmawng a um sih a, vansawlsiengte leh hagau zong a um sih hi, achi ua, hinanleh Pharisaiten tuate gel a um ahi chi ahum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n nasataha kiselbuoina a umta a, Pharisaite lam a pang laigiel mite adingdoh ua, tam mipa ah gitlouna bangma i mu sih uh, hinanleh hagau ahiei, vansawlsieng ahiei in akunga thu gen hikha leh, Pasian i dou sih ding uh, achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahing kiniel sang deudeu tah un, galkap lamkai lienpenpa’n Paul abawtel khah ding uh azau a, galkapte va pei suh a, amaute lah a kipat Paul va pummat a, galkapte giehbuh a hing zawpi dingin thu apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hinanleh azingni zanin, Paul kungah Mangpa ava dinga, Paul hamuong tahin um in; Jerusalem khuo a ka thu theipina thu na gen bangin, Rome khopi ah zong ka thu na theisah ding hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zing khuo ahing vah tahin Judate pawlkhat thu akikum ua, Paul atha masangsie ua, bangma ne leh dawn lou dingin, akichiemta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tambanga thu phiel dap a pawl kibawlte mi sawmli sanga tamzaw ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amaute siempu liente leh upate kung ah ahing pei ua, Paul ka tha masangsie ua, bangma nelou dingin kichiemna dettahin ka kichiem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuaziehin nouten vaihawm pawlte toh, athu dong chien zawsem ding kipang unlen, zing chienga na kung ua hing puikhe suh dingin galkap lamkai lienpenpa kungah vagen un, tualeh ama na kung uh ahing tun masanga na that ding a mansa ka hi uh, achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hinanleh Paul sanggamnu tapa in, ana dapbuh thu uh aza a, galkapte giehbuh ah avalut a, Paul kungah avahil ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n Paul in galkap zahoutu khat akung ah ahan a, Tam tangvalpa, galkap lamkai lienpenpa kungah va zawpi in, aman akungah gen ut anei hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman galkap lienpenpa kungah azawpi a, hentapa Paul in akungah ahing han a, tam tangvalpa na kunga zawpi dingin ahing ngen hi. Aman na kungah gen ding bang ahiei khat anei hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n galkap lamkai lienpenpa’n akhut in atu a, atuomin apuidoh a, ka kunga na gen ut bang ahiei? chi’n adap doh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aman, Paul thu kichien sema dongchien nuom kipangin zing chienga vaihawm pawlte kunga puisuh dingin Judaten hing nget lem asata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hinanleh athu uh na zop sin, aziehpen alah ua mi sawmli sanga tamzawten adap buh ua, tua miten Paul atha masangsie ua, bangma nelou leh dawnlou dingin akichiem uhi, tualeh tuin na thu ngah in mansa in a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuachi’n galkap lamkai lienpenpa’n tangvalpa apei sahta a, Tam thu na hing theisahta chi, koima hil sin, chiin thu apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh galkap zahoutu ni ahan a: keng galkap zani toh, sakol tungtuong galkap sawm sagi toh, teipi tawi galkap zani toh, tuzan nai kuona a Kaisaria zuon a pei dingin kisa un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh Paul tuonna ding sakolte mansain guot unlen, uhpipa Felix kungah ama bittahin tunpi un, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tualeh aman tambangin laithot agiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Klaudia Lisia in, azatat huoi mama uhpipa Felix, chibai abuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tam mipa, Judate’n amat ua atha ding kuon un, ama Rome khopi mi ahi chi ka za a, galkapte toh kuon in kava hunkhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ama ahehna uh thei nuom in, avaihawm mite uh kungah ka peipi a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />ahehna thu uh amauh dan toh kisai ahi a, shina ding khop leh khainienga kaanna ding khop hehna ahi sih, chi ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tualeh Judaten ama alambuh uh chi, mi’n ahing hil tahin, na kungah ama ka hing sawl pai hi, tua ban ah, ama ahehna uh nang kung tun dingin ama hehte zong thu ka pie hi, Mangpha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuachi’n athupieh bangin galkapten azan azan in Paul azawpi ua, Antipatri atun uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Azingni in sakol tungtuong galkapte’n Paul azawpi ua, adang teng giehbuh ah akinuale ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Amaute Kaisaria atun tahun, uhpipa kungah laithot apie ua, Paul zong amasangah ading sah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Uhpipa’n laithot asim a, Paul umna gam adonga, Sisillia gam ahi chi atheitah in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Nang hing hehte ahing tun chiengun, na thu ka ngaikhe ding achi hi. Tualeh Paul pen Herod vaihawmna innsunga koi dingin thu apie hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ninga nuain Siempu lien Anania, upate leh dansiem Tertullus toh ahing peisuh ua, Paul amawsahna thute uh uhpipa kungah ahing tun uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Paul hatlut ahitahin, Tertullus in Paul aheh pan pai a, zatat huoi Pu Felix aw, “Nangma vangin Kouten lemna leh muonna thupitah ka neita ua, mailam hun na mulawhna in tam nam a dingin nopsahna ahing tun a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bangchih lai pouin mun chin ah, lungdam tahin ka kipah ngitnget uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahivang in nang dinga chimtahhuoi ka hilouna dingin, na hepina a, ka thu uh themkhat hing ngaikhiet pieh dingin, ka hing ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aziehpen kouten tam mi muda huoitah, leitunga Judate zousie tohbuoipa leh Nazareth mite pawl a alamkaipen khat uh ahi, ka thei uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aman biehinnpi nangawn suhbua atum a, tualeh ama ka man ua, kouma dan toh kituoh a atunga thukhen ka sawm uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hinanleh galkap lamkai lien Lisia ka kung uah ahing pei a, thagum hat in ka khut ua kipat ang lah piehta hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama hehte nangma kunga hing pei dingin thu ahing pie hi. Nangma mama in ama dongchien lachin, ka hehna thute uh na thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh Judaten zong, ama ahehna thu zousie adih ahina chi’n apang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n uhpipa’n thugen dingin Paul akhutzap a, Paul in adawnna agen a: “Kum tam tah tam namte thukhen piehpa na hi chi ka thei ziehin, kipahtahin ka dihna thu ka gen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jerusalem a Pasian be dinga ka peitou nua ni sawm leh ni ni val ahi nai sih ding chi na thei thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kei hing hehte’n biehinnpi a mi toh ka kiniel ahiei, ahisihleh kikhopna inn leh khopi sunga mipi ka chiilsietna bangma amu sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuin zong ahing hehnate uh, kichientahin abul asuikhe thei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hinanleh tam thu na kungah ka phuong ahi, Amaun bieh dan tuom achi uh Lam zui in ka pu leh pate uh Pasian ka bie a, dan leh guolneite laibu a kigiel zousie gingta ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mi dihtatte leh mi dihtatloute thawkiana a um ding chia amaute’n zong agintat uh, tua khu ken zong Pasian ah ka kineppi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tambang ahiziehin, Pasian leh mihing lama sie leh pha theikhenna nei a suhkhiel bei a um dingin ka kipaubawl vevaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kum tampi nuain ka nampite kunga, silpiehte pe ding leh sillatte lan dingin ka hing pei a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Alah uah Asia gam a hing kipan Juda miten ka kisiensuo laitah ahing mu ua, mipite toh ka umkhawm nai sih a, buoina zong a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua miten ka tunga thubuoi nei ahi uleh tanah na masanga um in, hing heh u’leh ave le.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahisihleh tam mite ngel in zong vaihawm mite masanga ka din laiin, ka bawlkhelna mu anei u’leh tua na masanga ka din laiin gen uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amaute mai a mishi thawkiana thu ah, tunia noute masang a thukhenna tuoh dinga din sah a ka um, chia ka kikou khu ahiloungal leh chiin adawng hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hinanleh Felix in tam thute azah tahin, tua ‘Lam’ thu khu atheichien deuta a, amaute kung ah, “Galkap lamkai lienpen Lisia ahing tun suh chiengin na thu uh, thutanna ka bawl ding hi,” chiin akhawlsah ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman galkap zahoutu khat kungah, Paul khu venga zalen deu a um sah a, alawmten aneh leh dawn abawlpieh uleh ahing ve ding uh, khaam lou dingin thu apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ni bangza ahiei nuain Felix khu azi Judami Drusilla toh ahing pei ua, Paul ahan sah a, Khrist aginna thu angaikhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Paul in dihtatna thute, kidehna thute leh vaihawmna hing tung ding thute agen leh Felix khu zau in achitun a, “Tuin peikia phot inlen, hun lem ka nei chiengin ka hing han kia ding” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuabangkaal ah ahakhietna dinga, Paul in sum apieh ding bang akinem a, Paul ahan sah mun mama a ahoupi thimthem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hinanleh kum ni zouin Porsia Festus in Felix ahing hengta a, tualeh Felix in Judate kipahsah a ut a, Paul khu kaansa in anuasieta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Festus tua gam ahingtun nua ni thumin Kaisaria apat in Jerusalem ah ahaw tou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n siempu liente leh Juda lamkaiten akungah Paul tungthu ahilou lam a atheisah kawm un hehna apie uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lampi a ana buhdap ua, atha theina dingun, akungah Paul khu Jerusalem a ahattouna dingin deisahna angen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hinanleh Festus in Paul pen Kaisaria a kep ding ahi, Keima zong khum langa peipai ding ka hi, chiin adawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Tuachi’n” aman, “Paul in gitlouna nei ahileh na lah ua thuneiten hing zui suh u’henlen, heh uheh” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Festus alah ua ni sawm val ataam nuain Kaisaria ah apei suh kiata hi. Azingniin thukhenna toupha ah atou a, Paul hing pui dingin thu apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Paul ahing tun tahin, Jerusalem akipata hing peisuh Judate akim ah ading ua, atungah agen chien theilou uh hehna nasatah tampiin aheh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Paul in adihna thu agen a, “Judate dan thu hiin, biehinnpi thu hitaleh, tualeh Kaisar tungah hitaleh, bangma ka bawlkhiel mawngmawng sih hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hinanleh Festus in Judate deilam bawl a ut a, Paul adawnga tualeh akungah, “Jerusalem a peitou a, khunah ka mai a tam thute ngaituo hileh na ut ei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n Paul in, “Kaisar thukhenna toupha mai a thukhenpieh a um dingin ka ding hi; Judate tungah bangma ka bawl khiel sih chi nang chientahin na thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Migilou ka hi a, shina khop a sil bawlkhiel ka hileh, shi zong ka niel sih hi; hinanleh tam mite hing hehnate adihlou ahi nua in, Koiman amaute khut a ahing pieh thei uh ka hi sih, Kaisar kungah ka tut ding,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n Festus in avaihawmpite toh akikup zou un, adawnga, “Kaisar kungah tut na tum maw? Kaisar kungah na tung ngei ding hi” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh ni bangza ahiei nua in, Lengpa Agrippa leh Bernisi Kaisaria ah Festus nousiet dingin ahing pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amaute khuna ni tampi atam nua un, Festus in leengpa kungah “Paul tungthu agen a, Felix in, suongkul taangmi khat anuasie a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jerusalem a ka um laiin siempu liente leh Juda upaten athu ahing theisah ua, siemlou tangsah dingin ahing ngen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ken akung uah, ahehpa u’leh ahehte akimaituo ua, ahehna thu ua, ama adihna thu genna hun lemtang anei masangin, mi koima gawt dinga piehdoh pen Romemite dan ahisih hi, chiin ka dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaziehin amaute tam mun a ahing peikhawm tah un, zekai louin, azingni in thukhenna toupha ah ka tou a, tua mipa hing pui dingin thu ka pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama hehtute ahing din tah un, ka gintat bangtahin atung ah gitlouna hehna bangma agen thei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hinanleh amauh bieh dante leh, mi khat, ashisa, Paul in ahing kia hi chia agen thu a, kinielna nei ahizaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh ken tuabang dohnate ka theisiem lou ziehin, Jerusalem a peitou a, khuna tam thute khen a ut leh utlou ka dong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hinanleh Paul in athukhen dinga Augustus kunga thu atut zieh in, Kaisar kunga ama ka sawldoh thei masangsie ama veng dingin thu ka pie hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuachi’n Agrippa in Festus kungah, “Ken zong tua mipa thugen ka ngaikhe nuom hi,” achi hi. Aman “Zing chiengin” “Ama thugen na ngaikhe ding” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuachi’n azingni in Agrippa leh Bernisi thupitah in ahing pei ua, galkap lamkai liente leh khopi miliente toh thugenna inn ah alut ua; Festus in thu apie a, Paul ahing pui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh Festus in “Leengpa Agrippa leh tammun a ka kung ua um mi zousiete aw, tam mipa na mu uhi, ama pen Juda mipite zousie in Jerusalem leh Kaisaria mun ah, ka kungah aheh ua, hing taah ahi nawn sih chiin akikou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hinanleh shina ding khop hiel bangma abawl sih chi ka thei hi, aman Augustus kunga athu tut atup ziehin sawl dingin pha ka sat a hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hinanleh ka toupa kunga ama tungthu gel ding kichientah bangma ka nei sih hi. Tuaziehin na masang uah ka hing puikhie ahi; leengpa Agrippa, adiehin nangma masanga hing pui tuonse ka hi, aziehpen athu na dohchien nua a gel ding themkhat ka nei theina dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Aziehpen hehna kichientah genlou a, henta khat hing sawlpen kei adingin bawldan kilawm hiin ka thei sih hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Agrippa in Paul kungah, “Na dihna thu na gen thei hi,” achi hi. Tuachi’n Paul in akhut azah a adihna thu agen panta a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Lengpa Agrippa aw, Judaten ahing hehna zousie ah ka dihna thu tunia na mai a ka gen thei ding ziehin hampha ka kisa hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Adiehin, Judate toh kisai tawndan leh thubuoi zousie thu a pil mama na hi ziehin hampha ka kisa hi. Tuaziehin ka thu lungduoi tah a hing ngaikhiet pieh dingin ka hing ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Ka naupan lai akipat Jerusalem khuo a keima chi leh namte lah a ka hindan leh ka khankhiet dan achiil akipat, Judate zousie in athei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Achiil akipat in ka tanchin athei uhi, ka sakhuo dan ua akulmut pen dungzui a, hinkhuo na zang Pharisai ka hi chi a ut uleh agen thei tham ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh tuin, Pasian in ka pu ka pate uh kunga thuchiem ana bawl kineppina ziehin, thukhenpieh a umin ka ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua thuchiem kinem in ka minam uh nam sawm leh nam ni ten, sun leh zan in Pasian nna phatuomngai tah in ka sem uhi. Lengpa Agrippa aw, tam kinepna ziehin Judate’n ahing heh uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pasian in mishite akaithou chi bang dinga nouten gintat huoilou a ngaituo na hi uoi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Keima mama in zong Nazareth Jesu min dou a sil tampi bawllou theilou in kana kingai hi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuabangin Jerusalem khuo ah zong ka na bawl zel hi. Siempu liente akipat in thuneina lai muin misiengthoute tampi suongkul ah ka khum hi, tualeh amauh atha lai un, phasahpi lam ah ka na pang zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh kikhopna inn chin ah amaute ka gawt zel a, Jesu min gensiet sah teitei ka tum hi; tualeh atung uah ka lungthah sengsenga, amaute gawt dingin gamdang khopite nangawn ah ka kuon zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Tuabang bawl dingin, siempu liente akipat thuneina muin, asawlna lai uh tawi in Damaska khopi zuon in ka pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lengpa aw, lampi a ka pei laiun, sunkim laitahin van a kipat in vah ni sanga vahpha zaw, kei leh ka zawpite kim a ahing taang ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka unpi un tuol ah ka pua ua, Hebru ham in Saul, Saul, nang bangdinga hing sugenthei na hiei? Kilna sia zumte peh nanga dingin ahasa hi, chi a hing houpi aw khat ka za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n ken, koi na hiei Mangpa? Ka chi a, tualeh Aman na suhgenthei Jesu ka hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hinanleh thou inlen na kengin dingin, tam na sil mute leh na kunga ka hing musah nahlai dingte, theipitu hi ding leh nna sem dinga hing bawl dingin na kunga hing kilah ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Judate leh tua ka hing sawlna Jentelte khut a kipat ka hing hundoh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jentelte mit suvah ding leh miel apata vahlam ngasah dingin, tualeh Setan thuneina apat Pasian lama akihei theina ding u’leh khelna ngaidamna amu theina ding u’leh kei ahing gintat zieh ua, kisusiengte lah a goutan anei theina ding uh ahi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Tuaziehin, Aw leengpa Agrippa, vanlam kilahna thumanglou in ka um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hinanleh amasa penin Damaska khuo a mite kungah, tuachi’n Jerusalem khuo a mite kungah, tuaban ah Juda gam pumpi a mite kungah, tualeh Jentelte kung ah zong, akisia ua Pasian lam a akihei ua, kisiana toh kituoh nna asepna dingun ka genzah ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tamte ziehin Judaten biehinnpi ah ahing man ua, tha ahing tum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pasian a kipat panpina ka mu ziehin, tuni tan in mi neute leh mi liente kungah theipina thu gen in ka ding na lai hi. Guolneite leh Mosi in hing tung ding ahi chi a agente uh chiloungal thudang ka gen sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Khrist in genthei athuoh dinga, mishite lah a thoukia masapen ahi dinga, tualeh Judate leh Jentelte kunga vah amusah ding, chi thu ahi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Paul in tambanga adihna thu agen lai in, Festus in aw ngai tahin, “Paul amaw hita teh, na siemna in hing su maw gawp ahita,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hinanleh Paul in “Zatat huoi Festus aw, amaw ka hi sih hi, thudihtah leh pilna thu gen ka hi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tam thute akunga leengpa’n zong athei hi, tuazieh in akung a zau lou a ka genna a hi, tam silte akungah bangma im ahisih chi ka thei hi, tam silte aningkawma kidap bawl ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Lengpa Agrippa aw, guolneite thu na gingta ei? Na gingta chi ka thei hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuachi’n Agrippa in Paul kungah, “Hun tomnou sungin Khristian hing suoh sah tum na hi” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Paul in, “Tom in sawt taleh, nang maimai hilou in, tuni a ka thu za zousie keima banga um dingin, Pasian kungah ka ngen hi, tam kolte vang bun louin,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tam thute agen zoutah in, leengpa leh uhpipa leh Bernisi tualeh akunga toute zousie zong ading chiet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tualeh atuom a apawtdoh nua un, akihou ua, “Tam mipa’n shina leh kolbuna khop hiel, sil bangma abawl sih hi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuachi’n Agrippa in Festus kungah, “Tam mipa’n Kaisar kunga a thu tut sawmlou hileh hakhiet thei mai ding hiven,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Itali gam a tembaw a ka pei dinguh thu phatsah ahi tahin, Paul leh suongkul taang koite ahiei khu Augustus pawl galkap zahoutupa amin Julius kichipa khut ah akemsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n Asia gam tuipi gei tawn a peiding Adramitium tembaw ah ka tuong ua, ka kipankheta uhi. Aristarkus kichi, Thessalonika khuo a teng Masidonia gam mi khat ka tuonpi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Azingni in Sidon ka tung uhi. Tualeh Julius in Paul ahoi bawl a, Paul tahsapna ana pieh theina dingun alawmte kunga zalentaha ahaw ding aphal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuana pat in tembawin ka pei kia ua, hui ahing le lan ziehin Saipras gam lie lam ah ka pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Silisia gam leh Pamphilia lampang tuipi gei zuia ka peisuh nua un, Lisia gam a Mira khopi ka tung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuanah galkap zahoutupain Itali gam zuon ding Alekzandria tembaw khat amu a, tuanah ahing tuongsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Awl-awl in ni tampi ka pei ua, hasatahin Nidas ka tung hamham ua, hui ahat ziehin tangtahin ka pei theita sih ua, Salmone zuon in Kret tuilaisie gam lie lam ah ka pei zawta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hasatah a peisuohin Lasia khopi kunga um tembaw khawlna kilawm kichi mun ka tung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n ni tampi abeita, tualeh tembaw a pei azauhuoi ziehin, anngawlni na ngawn abeita a, Paul in amaute thu ahilta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Pute aw, ikhuolzinna tembaw in sietna leh manna nasetah tuoh ding ahi chi ka thei hi, tembaw vante leh atembaw guoh hilouin, ihinna nasan uh azauhuoi ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahivang in, galkap lamkaipa’n Paul gen sangin tembaw hehpa leh aneipa thu agingta zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh phalbi sunga umna dingin tembaw khawlna mun akitup lou ziehin, atamzawin, tuana kipata kitawldoh a Phoeniks tun teitei a, khuna phalbi sung um ding asawmta uhi. Phoeniks pen Kret tuilaisie gama tembaw khawlmun khat ahia, simtum lam leh maltum lam nga ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sim hui nem awl awl a ahing lan tahin, adei lam uh muta in akingaituo ua, tembaw henkipnate asut ua, Kret tuipi gei zuiin akitawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hinanleh hun tomkhat zouin Kret tuilaisie gam a kipat in Euroklidon kichi huipi hattah ahing laang suh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua huipiin tembaw ahing phuta a, hui lah ah ka pei zou nawn sih ua, ka hakheta ua, tuachi’n ahing taw kawikawita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh Klauda achi uh tuilaisie gam khat zul zul ah ka tai ua, hasatahin kuong neu khu ka bitsah thei hamham uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Akaidoh zou un, apanpina khaute azuun ua tembaw nuoi lam ah aviel ua, tualeh Sirtis senel lah ah hing lenlutpi khava chi zauin puonzahnate apuasah ua, tuachi’n ahing mawh taw kawikawita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huipi hat in hing mutleeng kawikawi ahiziehin, azingni in tembaw jangsah dingin tembaw vante tuipi ah apaidoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ani thum niin tembaw vante ka khut ngei un ka paidoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nitamtah ni leh aasite kilang louin, huipi hattah alaang zinga, hin ding mawngmawng ka ki nem nawn sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hinanleh sawtpi ann ne lou a, a um nua un, Paul alah uah ahing dinga, “Pute aw, Kret tuilaisie apat kipandoh lou dingin ka thugen ngaikhie uh lachin, tambang sietna leh manna tuoh lou ma ding hive u’chin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuin lungmuong taha um dingin ka hing ngen ahi, aziehpen na lah uah koiman ahinna amansuo sih ding uh, hinanleh tembaw pen ase ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aziehpen Ama a ka hi a, ana zong ka sep Pasian vansawlsieng tuzanin ka kungah ahing dinga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Zau sin Paul, Kaisar mai ah na ding ngei ngei ding hi, tualeh ngaiin, tembaw a na tuonpite zousie zong Pasian in ahing pieh na hita, ahing chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuaziehin pute aw, lungmuong tahin um un, Pasian ka gingta a, ahing hil bangbangin a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahivang in tuilaisie gam khat ah, ahing sepdoh ngei ngei ding hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hinanleh Adria tuipi a huipi in asuh atunga ahing sem leng uh azan sawm leh li zanin zankim lai ding velin tembaw heh mite’n gam khat tungding hiin akitheita uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tualeh tuithuh dan ate ua, lam sawmni hiin athei ua, gamla deu apei nua ua ate kia u’leh lam sawm leh nga, hiin athei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuachi’n suongpi phuhkhah ding azau ziehun, tembaw mei lamah sia-ka li akhie ua khovah ngah in thu angenta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tualeh tembaw hehmiten tembaw mai lam a sia kate khie kipangin kuongneu khu tuipi ah akhaikhie ua, tembaw taisan atum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Paul in galkap lamkaipa leh galkapte kungah “Tam mite kuonga a umden sih u’leh, na bit sih ding uh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuachi’n galkapte’n kuongneu khaute asattan ua, akesuh sahta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Khovah kuonin Paul in a unpi un ann ne dingin asawl a, “Tuni ann ngawl a na ngah ua, bangma ne lou a na umna uh ni sawm leh ni li ahita.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tuaziehin ann ne dingin ka hing ngen ahi; tam pen na hinna ding uh ahi, noute koiman asam zang khat zong amansuo sih ding,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Aman tam thute agen zouin tanghou ala a, amaute zousie masangah, Pasian kungah kipahthu agen a, tanghou abalkeh a, ane panta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaute ahing kithakhausah ua, ann ane chietta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tualeh tembaw sunga um zousie ka unpi un za ni leh sawmsagi leh guh ka hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tualeh ann aneh kham zou un tembaw jangsah dingin mangbute tui lah ah apaita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Zing khuo ahing vah tahin, agam chin athei ta sih ua, hinanleh tembaw khawlna pieutah nei tuipi pang khat amu ua, ahithei liei leh khuna tembaw tawllut atum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Amauten sia kate akhesuh ua, tuipi ah anuasie ua, tualeh tembaw heina puonjahte asut ua, amailam a puonjahpen hui sem dingin azahtou ua, tuachi’n pieutah lam zuon in apei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tuachi’n tuilienpi ni kisuhtuona ah ka lut kha ua, tembawin lei asusah ta ua, tembaw mailam lei ah akiphut detta a, suhling guollouin a umta hi, ameilam pen tuihuol ahat zieh in akehta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Galkapten saltangte tuizap a galkai umkha va uh, achi zieh un, tha atumta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Hinanleh galkap lamkaipa in, Paul hundam a ut ziehin, asil tup uh akhaam a, tuizap siem pouma tuipi a tawmdoh a, pieutah a galkai masa dingin thu apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tualeh adangte pawl khat kuong dang tungah pawl khatte tembaw sie singpeh ahiei a tuong a galkai dingin thu apie hi. Tuachi’n a unpi un bit tahin agalkai chiet ta uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuipi gei a bittah a ka suohtat nua un tua tuilaisie gam khu Malta ahi chi ka theita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Agam mite ka tung uah asiem mama ua, guozu a adap ziehin mei ataw ua, ka unpi un ahing na kipahpi mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Paul in singkang lom khat atom a mei a avah leh meisa in ahul ziehin gul khat ahing pawtdoh a, akhut atu a, akikhai denta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n agam miten Paul khut a gul kikhaiden amutahun, “Tam mipa tuolthat hi ngeingei va, tuipi akipat suohta nanleh dihtah a thukhennain ahin ding phal nawnlou ahita,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hinanleh Paul in tua gul khu meikhua ah athingkhie a, bangma achi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahivang in amauten akhut hing pawm ahiei, ahisihleh thakhat a pua a shi pai dingin agingta uhi; hinanleh sawtpi angah nua ua bangma achilou tahin, alungsim uh aheng ua, pasien ahi achi zawta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua mun khu, tua tuilaisie a mi poimawtah amin Publius kichipa gam ahia, aman ahing na kipahpi a ngainatahin ni thum ahing zintungsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh Publius pa khosih leh santen in ana lum a; Paul akungah avalut a, atunga khut ngain, thu angen a asudam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n tambanga abawl tahin, tua tuilaisie gam a mi dang natna nei zousie zong ahing pei ua, adam chietta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amauten lam tampi ah koute ahing pahtawi ua, tualeh ka pei kuon un ka poimaw uh ahing guon uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ha thum nuain, Alekzandria tembaw phalbi sung tua tuilaisie a taam, achiemtena unau piengkop kichi ah ka tuong ua ka peita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sirakus ah ka kinga ua, tuanah ni thum ka taam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuana pat in ka pei kuol ua, Rhegium ka tung ua, tualeh ni khat zouin sim hui ahing langa, azing niin Puteoli ka tung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua khuo ah sanggamte ka mu ua, akung ua ni sagi taam dingin ahing hou ua; tuachi’n Rome khopi lam zuon in ka pei zelta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Rome khopi a um sanggamte’n ka tanchin uh azah tahun Appii sumsinna mun leh zinbuh thum tandong hing peiin ahing dawn ua, Paul in amaute amu tahin Pasian kungah kipahthu agen a alungmuongta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Rome khuo ka tun un galkap zahoutupain hentate khu vengmi galkap lamkaipa khutah apekhie a, hinanleh Paul pen vengmi galkap khat toh amatanga a um ding phalna apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh ni thum nuain Juda lamkaite ahankhawm a, amaute ahing kikhop tahun, Paul in akung uah, “Sanggamte aw, imite leh ipu ipate tawndan kal a bangma ka bawllou vangin, Jerusalem a kipat in henta a piehkhiet ka hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A hing etdih nua un, ka tunga shina khop hiel bangma a umlou ziehin ahing hadoh ut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hinanleh Judaten aniel zieh un, Kaisar kungah ka thu tutlou thei ka hita sih hi; ka nampite hehna a bawl vang ka hi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuazieha tam thute a noute toh kimutuo a, kihoulim dinga ka hing hatkhawm mawng ahi; Israelte kinepna zieha tam khainieng a kaan ka hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh amauten akungah, “Kouten Judia gama kipat, na tungthu ah laithot ka mu sih uh. Tua gam a kipat a tam mun a hing pei unaute koiman na tungthu aselam in bangma agen ngai sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hinanleh na ngaidan nangma akipat ka za nuom uhi. Aziehpen tam Pawlte gam chin a agensiet uh, ka na thei uhi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuachi’n ani ding aguot ua, tua ni ahing tun tahin, ama umna ah mi tampi ahing pei ua, zingmawnga kipat nitah lam dongin akung uah Pasian leenggam thu hilchien in atheisah a, Mosi dan laibu leh guolneite laibute suutpi in Jesu lam ah amaute azawllut sawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kimkhatten athugen agingta ua, pawlkhatten agingta sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Amaute akithutuoh theilou bep un, Paul in thu khat agen zouin akikhenta uhi. Paul thugen khu tami ahi: “Hagau Siengthou in guolnei Isai kam a ipu ipate kunga ana gen khu thudih ahi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tam mite kungah va pei inlen, va genin, zah pen na za ding ua, na theisiem sih ding uh; mu pen na mu ding ua, na theidoh sih ding uh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Aziehpen tam mite lungtang angong gawpta a, abilte uh ahum ua, tualeh amitte uh asiing uhi; tuachilouin amit un amu kha ding ua, alungtang un atheisiem kha ding ua, tuachi’n ahing kihei ding ua, ken kana sudam kha ding hi,” achi khu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuaziehin Pasian hundamna thu Jentelte kunga sawl ahita a, amauten angaikhe ding uh, chi thei un, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tam thute Paul in agen zouin, Judate amaute lahah akiniel ua, akikhenta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Paul khu kum ni sung vingveng ama innluona ah atenga, ama mu nuom pouma ana kipahpi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Pasian leenggam thu agen a, Mangpa Jesu Khrist tungthu hangsan tahin ahil zel a, koiman ama akham sih hi.
  </para>
</usx>
